<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id">- Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc3">Josh</para>
  <para style="toc2">Joshuwa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha Joshuwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">JOSHUA</para>
  <para style="imt">ICHILONGOLE</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOS 1" />
  <para style="s">IMNDEWA Imulungu komlaghitsa Yoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 1:1" />Hayafile Musa, imtumighwa wa IMNDEWA Imulungu, IMNDEWA kamlongela Yoshua mwana wa Nuni, iyali mtumighwa wa Musa, <verse eid="JOS 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 1:2" />“Imtumighwa wangu Musa kafa. Lelo ghweghwe na Waisiraeli wose mwisafulule mloke ghumto ghwa Yoridani, mghende mna isi yanibama kuweng'a. <verse eid="JOS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 1:3" />Nitsomwing'ani chila hanu hambita, ka pfanilaghane na Musa. <verse eid="JOS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 1:4" />Imibaka ya isi yenu itsakuwa apfino, ubali wa kusini mtsebakana na inyika, ubali wa kasikazini mtsebakana na pfidunda pfa Lebanoni, ubali wa mashaliki mtsebakana na ghumto aghula mkulu ghwa Efurati, na ubali wa maghalibi mtsebakana na isi yose ya Wahiti mbaka kuna ibahari ya Mediteraniya. <verse eid="JOS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 1:5" />Haduhu munu iyatsakwima yetowe na ghweghwe mna ghamatsuwa ghose gha ughima wako, ka pfanimwapfile Musa, naghwe nitsokwapfila pfipfo. Nitsokala naghwe na wala sitsokuleka baye. <verse eid="JOS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 1:6" />Ughangamale na uleke kutenyuka, kwaapfila kutsowalongotsa iwanu awano kuihala isi yanilahile kuweng'a iwahenga wawo iwalongole. <verse eid="JOS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 1:7" />Ughangamale na uleke kutenyuka, walangitse kughakinda malaghitso ghose ghayakwing'ile mtumighwa wangu Musa. Uleke kughabetsa ghamalaghitso agho, naghwe kutsobweda kwokwose kwaughenda. <verse eid="JOS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 1:8" />Walangitse uleke kwisemwa ukusoma ichitabu achino cha ghamalaghitso, ughalangule ghose ighandikighwe mumo chilo na misi, ili udahe kughawinza pfinoghile ghose ighali mumo, naghwe kutsobweda na kupata ghose. <verse eid="JOS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 1:9" />Apfi si nene baye yanikulaghitse? Ughangamale na uleke kutenyuka. Uleke kupfuka wala kuya kuchughu, kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu kahamwe naghwe kwokwose kwaughenda.”<verse eid="JOS 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshua kowalaghitsa iwanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 1:10" />Apfo Yoshua kawalaghitsa pfilongotsi wa Waisiraeli kalonga, <verse eid="JOS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 1:11" />“Mbite mna tsindalo tsa iwanu na muwalongele apfino, ‘Mwike ipfijo pfiwe pfingi, kwaapfila matsuwa madatu haghomala mtsoloka ghumto Yoridani, kughenda kuisola isi iyaweng'ile IMNDEWA iwe yenu.’ ”<verse eid="JOS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 1:12" />Kuya Yoshua kawalongela iwanu wa kabila lya Rubeni na Gadi na nusu ya kabila lya wanu wa Manase kalonga, <verse eid="JOS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 1:13" />“Mleke kwisemwa laghitso lya Musa imtumighwa wa IMNDEWA Imulungu lyamwing'ileni ahala hayalongile, ‘IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu katsomwing'ani hanu ha ukubwihila, na katsomwing'ani isi aino.’ <verse eid="JOS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 1:14" />Wehe wenu, iwana wenu, na imifugho yenu, ikale mna isi iyamwing'ileni Musa, kumwambu akuno kwa ghumto Yoridani, lekeni iwamale wose iwodaha kwitowa watsoloka ghumto aku wakinda tsisilaha, kuwalongolela wandughu tsenu. <verse eid="JOS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 1:15" />Mtsowapfila mbaka IMNDEWA hayatsoweng'a hanu ha ukukala tseghamba, ka pfayawatendele mwemwe, nawo waisole isi ayo iwe yawo, iyoweng'a IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. Kuya muye mna isi yenu wenyegho, isi iyaweng'ile Musa imtumighwa wa IMNDEWA ili kumwambu mwa Yoridani, kwalilawila litsua.”<verse eid="JOS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 1:16" />Wamwidika Yoshua walonga, “Ghose agho ghautulaghitse tutsotenda, na kwokwose kwaututuma tutsoghenda. <verse eid="JOS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 1:17" />Ka pfatumtegheletse Musa mna ghose ghayatulaghitse, naghwe tutsokutegheletsa pfipfo. IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako yakale naghwe ka pfayakalile na Musa. <verse eid="JOS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 1:18" />Imunu wowose iyolema kukinda laghitso lyako, au iyolema kukinda malonga ghako, na chochose chaulaghitsa, katsokomighwa. Lekeni ghweghwe ughangamale na uleke kutenyuka.”<verse eid="JOS 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOS 2" />
  <para style="s">Yoshua kowatuma wapelembi Yeriko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 2:1" />Kuya Yoshua mwana wa Nuni, kawatuma chinyelenyele wanu weli kulawa Shitimu, waghende wakaipelembe isi ya Kanaani, hasa ghumji ghwa Yeriko. Waghenda wapfika ukaye kwa pinga yumwe chiweghe iyakemighwe Rahabu, na wakala baho. <verse eid="JOS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 2:2" />Imfalume wa ghumji ghwa Yeriko kalongelighwa apfino, “Lola! Waisiraeli weli watsa chilo chino kuipelemba isi yetu.” <verse eid="JOS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 2:3" />Imfalume wa Yeriko kawatuma wasenga waghende kwa Rahabu, kalonga, “Walapfe kunze iwanu iwengile mng'anda mwako, kwaapfila watsa kuipelemba isi.” <verse eid="JOS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 2:4" />Lekeni ipinga ayo tsakawasola iwapelembi awala weli, kawapfisa, kuya kawalongela iwasenga wa mfalume wa Yeriko, “Ona, iwanu awo wanitsila, lekeni simanyile baye ka wolawila kwani. <verse eid="JOS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 2:5" />Ichilo hachingile na lilango lya ghumji haling'ali habehi kuhindighwa, iwanu awo weli woka, na siimanyile baye nzila yachi yawang'ile. Muwawinze sambi namwe mtsowona.” <verse eid="JOS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 2:6" />Lekeni yeye tsakawadinitsa mkano, na kawapfisa kwa mibeleghe iitumika kutengenetsa maghwanda matselu, iyaitandatse mchanya mwa ikano. <verse eid="JOS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 2:7" />Apfo iwanu awala iwatumighwe na mfalume, wawawinza Waisiraeli awo weli kwa nzila ighenda Yoridani, hanu hawalokelagha iwanu, baho iwanu iwawawinzile hawalawile kunze mwa ghumji, lilango lihindighwa. <verse eid="JOS 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 2:8" />Ng'ana iwapelembi awo wawase baye, Rahabu kawadinila mkano, <verse eid="JOS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 2:9" />kawalongela, “Nene nomanya ka IMNDEWA kamwing'ani isi aino, mwemwe mtutenda twingilighwe na wogha, na iwanu wose iwokala muisi amno wowapfukani sideke. <verse eid="JOS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 2:10" />Tuhulika IMNDEWA pfayaghatendile ghamatsi ghanyale mna ibahari ya Shamu hamng'ali mwolawa Misiri, na pfamuwatendele wafalume weli wa Waamori, Sihoni na Ogu, iwang'ali wokala kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani, yamuwakomile ghendo. <verse eid="JOS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 2:11" />Baho hatuhulike agho, imimoyo yetu tsaitenyuka ghendo, tukala twahela ngupfu, kwaapfila IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu, yuyo Imulungu wa kuchanya kulanga na hasi muisi. <verse eid="JOS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 2:12" />Apfo lelo nowalomba mwilahe kwa taghwa lya IMNDEWA ka mtsombonela libatsi nene na iwanu wa ikaye yangu, kwaapfila nene tsanimwonelani libatsi, mnanguse chitango ili niwatoghole. <verse eid="JOS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 2:13" />Mwilahe ka ng'amtsowakoma baye aba wangu na mai wangu, ndughu tsangu wamale na wapinga na wose iwali mkaye mwawo na kutukombola tuleke ukufa.”<verse eid="JOS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 2:14" />Iwamale awala wamlongela, “Ughima wenu uwo ughima wetu! Ka ng'ulonga baye achila chatutenda, tutsokutendela pfinoghile na kwa uluso, IMNDEWA wetu hayatsotwing'a isi aino.”<verse eid="JOS 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 2:15" />Apfo Rahabu kawahulumsa iwanu awo kwa lutsabi kubitila mdilisha, kwaapfila ing'anda yake tsaitsengighwa mna ubanda wa ghumji ghwa Yeriko. <verse eid="JOS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 2:16" />Ipinga ayo kawalongela, “Mghende kuchidunda mkepfise, ili awala iwowawinza waleke kuwona. Kaleni kuko kwa matsuwa madatu mbaka woye, kuya mlawe mke.” <verse eid="JOS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 2:17" />Iwamale awala wamlongela Rahabu, “Achila chatwilahile kuna ghweghwe tutsochitenda ghendo. <verse eid="JOS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 2:18" />Hatutsakwingila mna isi aino, wohe lutsabi ludung'u mna lidilisha lyautuhulumsile, uwatinganitse hamwe mng'anda mwako aba wako, mai wako, na lumbu tsako, na wose iwali mkaye mwako. <verse eid="JOS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 2:19" />Munu wowose iyatsolawa kunze na kughenda mnzila yang'akomighwa alwo lwake, na twetwe ng'atutsakuwa na totso baye. Lekeni munu wowose iyatsokala mng'anda mwako yang'akomighwa, ghweghwe utughoghe twetwe. <verse eid="JOS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 2:20" />Lekeni ung'amlongela munu wowose kwa achino chatutenda, ukwilaha akuno kwatwilahile kutsakuwa hela.” <verse eid="JOS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 2:21" />Naye kawalongela, “Iwe pfipfo ka pfamlongile.” Apfo kawalapfa kunze, nawo woka. Naye koha lutsabi lundung'u mna ilidilisha.<verse eid="JOS 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 2:22" />Hawokile, waghenda kuchidunda na wakala kuko matsuwa madatu, mbaka awala iwang'ali iwowabama hawoyile Yeriko, na wawawinza nzila yose na ng'awawonile baye. <verse eid="JOS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 2:23" />Kuya iwamale awala weli tsawoya wahulumka kulawa akula kuchidunda, waloka ghumto ghwa Yoridani na wapfika kwa Yoshua mwana wa Nuni, na wamlongela chila chinu ichiwalawile. <verse eid="JOS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 2:24" />Wamlongela Yoshua, “IMNDEWA katwing'a ghendo isi yose mna ghamwoko ghetu, iwanu wose iwokala amwo wotupfuka twetwe.”<verse eid="JOS 2:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOS 3" />
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli woloka ghumto Yoridani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 3:1" />Nemitondotondo, Yoshua na Waisiraeli wose walawa Shitimu. Hawaghupfikile ghumto Yoridani, weka tsindalo tsawo na wakala baho aku wobetetsa kuloka. <verse eid="JOS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 3:2" />Matsuwa madatu haghamalile, pfilongotsi wabita mna tsindalo, <verse eid="JOS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 3:3" />wawalongela iwanu, “Hamtsolyona Lisanduku lya laghano lya IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu lidutighwa na iwatambika Walawi, mtsolawa aho hamli na kuliwinza. <verse eid="JOS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 3:4" />Apfi pfipfo pfamtsoimanya inzila yachi ya ukubita, kwaapfila ng'ana mwang'e baye inzila aino. Lekeni mleke kulisoghelela habehi Lisanduku alyo, kaleni kutali chidogho, ka mighulu elufu imwe apfino.”<verse eid="JOS 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 3:5" />Yoshua kawalongela iwanu, “Mwitende mwele, kwaapfila ilupfi IMNDEWA Imulungu katsotenda pfinu pfa kukangawatsa mna mwemwe.”<verse eid="JOS 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 3:6" />Kuya kawalongela iwatambika, “Soleni lisanduku lya laghano, mlongole nalyo hambele ha iwanu.” Apfo walisola na walongola nalyo hambele ha iwanu. <verse eid="JOS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 3:7" />IMNDEWA Imulungu kamlongela Yoshua, “Leloli nitsakwandusa kukutenda woneke mkulu hambele ha iwanu wose wa Isiraeli, ili wamanye ka nene nahamwe naghwe ka pfanikalile hamwe na Musa. <verse eid="JOS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 3:8" />Uwalongele iwatambika awo iwoghala Lisanduku lya laghano, ‘Hamtsopfika mmbalimbali mwa ghumto Yoridani, mwime mna ghamatsi.’ ” <verse eid="JOS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 3:9" />Pfipfila Yoshua kawalongela Waisiraeli, “Soghelani hano habehi na mghategheletse malonga gha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.” <verse eid="JOS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 3:10" />Yoshua kaghendelela kulonga, “Apfi pfipfo pfamtsomanya ka Imulungu iyali mghima kahamwe namwe, na yeye katsowawinga, Wakanani, Wahiti, Wahivi, Waperisi, Wagirigashi, Waamoni na Wayebusi, aku mwolola kwa nenge tsenu. <verse eid="JOS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 3:11" />Mlole! Lisanduku lya laghano lya IMNDEWA wa isi yose lyolongola kuloka ghumto Yoridani. <verse eid="JOS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 3:12" />Lelo msaghule wamale kumi na weli kulawa mna ghamakabila gha Isiraeli, chila kabila yalawe munu yumwe. <verse eid="JOS 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 3:13" />Mighulu ya iwatambika iwoduta lisanduku lya laghano lya IMNDEWA wa isi yose, haitsokanyagha ghumto Yoridani, ghamatsi ghatsoleka ukuhulumka, na aghala ighohulumka kulawa kuchanya ghatsakwima ka sughulu.” <verse eid="JOS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 3:14" />Apfo iwanu walawa mna tsindalo tsawo, wakaloke ghumto Yoridani, aku iwatambika iwoduta lisanduku lya laghano wawalongolela. <verse eid="JOS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 3:15" />Hawapfikile iwatambika awo iwaghalile lisanduku lya laghano hana ghumto ghwa Yordani, ghumto ighumemagha ghamatsi mna ghumsimu ghwa ukupfuna, na maghulu ghawo haghakanyaghe mna ghamatsi gha ghumto aghwo, <verse eid="JOS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 3:16" />baho ghamatsi ighang'ali ghohulumka kulawa uchanya, tsaghema ghawa sughulu, ghamema mbaka kuna ghumji ghwa Adamu, ighuli habehi na isi ya Seratani. Ghamatsi ighang'ali ghohulumka kughenda bahari ya Araba, pfipfila tsaikemighwa ibahari ye Munyu, tsaghanyala ghendo, na iwanu waloka kughenda Yeriko. <verse eid="JOS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 3:17" />Waisiraeli hawang'ali woloka, iwatambika iwaghalile lisanduku lya laghano tsawema hanu hanyalile haghati ha ghumto Yoridani mbaka iwanu wose waloka.<verse eid="JOS 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOS 4" />
  <para style="s">Mabwe kumi na meli gha ukukumbuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 4:1" />Iwanu wose hawamalitse kuloka ghumto Yoridani, IMNDEWA kamlongela Yoshua, <verse eid="JOS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 4:2" />“Wasaghule wanu kumi na weli kulawa mna Waisiraeli awo, chila kabila munu yumwe, <verse eid="JOS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 4:3" />Walongele wasole mabwe kumi na meli ighali haghatighati mwa ghumto Yoridani, aho haghemile ghamaghulu gha iwatambika na mghasole mkagheke hanu hamtsowasa leloli.” <verse eid="JOS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 4:4" />Apfo Yoshua kawakema iwanu awo kumi na weli iyawasaghule, chila kabila munu yumwe, <verse eid="JOS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 4:5" />kawalongela, “Mlilongolele lisanduku lya laghano lya IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu, mghende mbaka haghatighati ha ghumto Yoridani, chila munu yakasole libwe mmayegha mwake, libwe limwe kwa chila kabila lya Isiraeli. <verse eid="JOS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 4:6" />Mwotenda apfo ili chiwe chitango mna mwemwe, na wanenu hawatsowaghutsa mna matsuwa ighakutsa, ‘Hebali ghamabwe aghano ghali ahano?’ <verse eid="JOS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 4:7" />Muwalongele apfino, ‘Lisanduku lya laghano lya IMNDEWA Imulungu haling'ali lyobita mna ghumto Yoridani, ghamatsi gha ghumto aghwo tsaghakimighwa ghaleke kuhulumka.’ Ghamabwe aghano ghatsowatenda Waisiraeli waleke kwisemwa achila ichilawile ahano mna ghamatsuwa ghawo ghose.” <verse eid="JOS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 4:8" />Apfo Waisiraeli watenda ka Yoshua pfayawalaghitse. Wasola ghamabwe agho kumi na meli, chila kabila lya Waisiraeli libwe limwe, ka Imulungu pfayamlaghitse Yoshua, na waghaduta mbaka kuna tsindalo tsawo, aho waghatula hasi. <verse eid="JOS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 4:9" />Kuya Yoshua kahimika mabwe ghangi kumi na meli haghati ha ghumto Yoridani, hanu hawemile iwatambika iwadutile lisanduku lya laghano. Na ghamabwe agho ghabaho mbaka leloli aino. <verse eid="JOS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 4:10" />Iwatambika awala iwadutile lisanduku lya laghano tsawema haghati ha ghumto Yoridani mbaka iwanu hawamalitse kutenda ghose ka IMNDEWA Imulungu pfayamlaghitse Yoshua. Naye Yoshua tsakatenda ghose ka pfayalaghitsighwe na Musa, apfo iwanu tsawasumka kuloka ghumto. <verse eid="JOS 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 4:11" />Iwanu wose hawamalile kuloka, iwatambika awala waloka na lisanduku lya laghano lya IMNDEWA na wapfika kumwambu, aku iwanu wose wolola. <verse eid="JOS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 4:12" />Iwanu wa kabila lya Rubeni na Wagadi na nusu ya likabila lya Manase, nawo waloka wawalongolela Waisiraeli aku wakinda tsisilaha, ka Musa pfayawalaghitse. <verse eid="JOS 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 4:13" />Iwanu iwopfika elufu alubaini aku wakinda tsisilaha tsawo wapfosa hambele ha IMNDEWA waghenda kuna lwanda lwa ghumji ghwa Yeriko kwa kwitowa. <verse eid="JOS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 4:14" />Mna litsuwa alyo IMNDEWA Imulungu kamtenda Yoshua yatunyighwe na Waisiraeli wose, nawo wamtegheletsa matsuwa ghawo ghose gha ughima wawo, ka pfawamtegheletse Musa.<verse eid="JOS 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 4:15" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Yoshua, <verse eid="JOS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 4:16" />“Walaghitse iwatambika iwadutile lisanduku lya laghano walawe kuna ghumto Yoridani.” <verse eid="JOS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 4:17" />Apfo Yoshua kawalaghitsa iwatambika awala kalonga, “Laweni mna ghumto Yoridani.” <verse eid="JOS 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 4:18" />Iwatambika awala iwadutile lisanduku lya lilaghano lya IMNDEWA Imulungu hawalawile haghatighati ha ghumto Yoridani na kukanyagha mmbalimbali mwa ghumto, ghamatsi gha ghumto Yoridani ghandusa kuhulumka na kumema keli ka tsapfaili mwanduso. <verse eid="JOS 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 4:19" />Waisiraeli tsawaloka ghumto Yoridani mna litsuwa lya kumi lya mwetsi ghwa kwanza, na wakala mna ghumji ghwa Giligali, mashaliki ya ghumji ghwa Yeriko. <verse eid="JOS 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 4:20" />Na ako Giligali Yoshua kaghemitsa ghamabwe aghala kumi na meli ighasolighwe kuna ghumto Yoridani. <verse eid="JOS 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 4:21" />Kuya Yoshua kawalongela Waisiraeli, “Mna ghamatsuwa ighakutsa watsukulu wenu wang'awaghutsa aba tsawo, ‘Hebali ghamabwe aghano ghali ahano?’ <verse eid="JOS 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 4:22" />Mtsowalongela apfino, ‘Waisiraeli tsawaloka ghumto Yoridani ighunyalile.’ <verse eid="JOS 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 4:23" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kaghanyatsa ghamatsi ighali mna ghumto Yoridani ili mwemwe mdahe kuloka, ka pfayaghatendile ghamatsi gha ibahari ya Shamu ghanyale, ili twetwe tuloke. <verse eid="JOS 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 4:24" />IMNDEWA Imulungu katenda apfo ili iwanu wose iwali muisi wadahe kumanya ka ghumoko ghwake ghuna ngupfu ng'ulu, ili namwe mghendelele kumtunya IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu matsua ghenu ghose.”<verse eid="JOS 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOS 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 5:1" />Wafalume wose wa Waamori, iwang'ali wokala kumwambu mwa maghalibi ya ghumto ghwa Yoridani, na wafalume wose wa Wakanaani, iwakalile kumwani mwa ibahari ya Mediteraniya, hawahulike ka IMNDEWA Imulungu kaghanyatsa ghamatsi mbaka Waisiraeli waloka, tsawapfuka na kwingilighwa na wogha kwitowa na Waisiraeli.<verse eid="JOS 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli wakwingila ngoma ako Giligali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 5:2" />Matsuwa agho IMNDEWA kamlongela Yoshua, “Usongole mabwe makomu ghawe mimaghe, na uwengitse ngoma Waisiraeli.” <verse eid="JOS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 5:3" />Apfo Yoshua kasongola ghamabwe agho ghawa mimaghe, na kawengitsa ngoma Waisiraeli ako Gibea Haaraloti. <verse eid="JOS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 5:4" />Yoshua kawengitsa ngoma kwaapfila iwamale wose iwalawile Misiri, wana imiyaka ya ukughenda kwitowa, tsawafa mnzila kunyika hawang'ali wolawa Misiri. <verse eid="JOS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 5:5" />Iwamale wose iwalawile Misiri tsawengila ngoma, lekeni iwanu wose iwelekighwe mnyika hawali mna ghumwanza kulawa Misiri ng'awengile ngoma baye. <verse eid="JOS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 5:6" />Waisiraeli tsawakala mna ghumwanza kwa miyaka alubaini kunyika mbaka iwamale wose iwakalile na miyaka ya ukughenda kung'ondo wafa kwaapfila ng'awamtegheletse baye IMNDEWA. IMNDEWA tsakelaha kuna wawo ka ng'awatsoyona baye isi aila inoghile kwa ukufugha na ukulima iyelahile kwa iwahenga wawo ka katsotwing'a twetwe. <verse eid="JOS 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 5:7" />Apfo iwana iyawenule IMNDEWA, iwoneke na iwanu awala iwalemile kumtegheletsa IMNDEWA, awo wawo Yoshua iyawengitse ngoma. Tsawang'ali kwingila ngoma kwaapfila ng'awengile ngoma baye hawang'ali mna ghumwanza. <verse eid="JOS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 5:8" />Iwamale wose hawamalile kwingila ngoma, wakala mna indalo mbaka wahona. <verse eid="JOS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 5:9" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Yoshua, “Leloli aino niwalapfila ichinyala cha Misiri.” Apfo hanu aho hakemighwa Giligali mbaka leloli aino. <verse eid="JOS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 5:10" />Nemihe ya litsuwa lya kumi na nne, Waisiraeli wadeng'elela ichihungo cha Pasaka ako Giligali mna ichiwala cha Yeriko kwawatsengile tsindalo tsawo. <verse eid="JOS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 5:11" />Ilupfi yake, Pasaka haimalile, tsawaja pfighate ipfilihela hamila, na madanu, ipfijo ipfilawile mna isi ayo. <verse eid="JOS 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 5:12" />Apfo kulawa litsuwa alyo hawajile ipfijo pfa isi ayo, Waisiraeli ng'awapatile keli baye ichijo ichikemighwe mana, lekeni mna ghumwaka aghwo tsawaja ipfijo pfa isi ya Kanaani.<verse eid="JOS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshua kolonga na imkulu wa lijeshi lya IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 5:13" />Yoshua hayang'ali habehi na Yeriko, baho kwona munu yumwe iyemile hambele hake kakinda limaghe mmoko mwake. Yoshua kamghendela kamghutsa, “Pfii ghweghwe kwa miyetu, au kwa yumwe wa awala iwotuhila?” <verse eid="JOS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 5:14" />Naye kamwidika, “Aka, nene sili miyenu baye, wala sili yumwe baye wa awala iwowahila, ila nene na mkulu wa lijeshi lya IMNDEWA.” Kuya Yoshua kenama ichihanga chake hasi, kamtamanila, na kamghutsa, “Angu IMNDEWA yana mbuli yachi kuna nene imtumighwa wake?” <verse eid="JOS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 5:15" />Imkulu ayo wa lijeshi lya IMNDEWA kamlongela, “Tsula imikwabatsa yako, kwaapfila hanu hawimile haenzeluka.” Na Yoshua katenda pfipfo.<verse eid="JOS 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOS 6" />
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli woghusola ghumji ghwa Yeriko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 6:1" />Ghamalango gha ukwingilila Yeriko tsaghahindighwa ghendo, ili Waisiraeli waleke ukwingila. Haduhu munu yadahile kwingila mghati wala kulawa kunze. <verse eid="JOS 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 6:2" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Yoshua, “Ulole nikwing'a ghumji ghwa Yeriko mmoko mwako, hamwe na imfalume wake na iwaasikali wake iwana libapfu lya ukwitowa. <verse eid="JOS 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 6:3" />Mwemwe na iwanu wose wa ing'ondo mghutsunguluke ghumji aghuno mala lumwe chila tsuwa, na mtende apfino kwa matsuwa sita. <verse eid="JOS 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 6:4" />Na watambika saba chila yumwe yakinde malati ya membe ya ng'olo mmale, walilongolele lisanduku lya lilaghano. Mna litsuwa lya saba mghutsunguluke ghumji aghwo ghwa Yeriko mala saba, aku iwatambika wotowa tsimalati tsawo. <verse eid="JOS 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 6:5" />Hawotsotowa tsimalati tsawo kwa litsi likulu, na iwanu wose hawotsohulika wakemelele, kuya imibanda ya ghumji itsakughwa. Aho iwanu watsoghughendela ghumji aghwo, chila munu kulawa hanu hake hayemile.”<verse eid="JOS 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 6:6" />Apfo Yoshua mwana wa Nuni kawakema iwatambika kawalongela, “Liduteni lisanduku lya lilaghano lya IMNDEWA Imulungu, na watambika saba walilongolele aku wakinda malati saba tsa membe tsa ng'olo wamale.” <verse eid="JOS 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 6:7" />Na kawalaghitsa iwanu apfino, “Lelo mghende, mghutsunguluke ghumji, na iwanu wana tsisilaha walilongolele lisanduku lya IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="JOS 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 6:8" />Yoshua hayamalitse ukulonga na iwanu, iwatambika iwakindile tsimalati saba tsa membe tsa ng'olo wamale wabita hambele ha IMNDEWA, walongola aku wotowa tsimalati tsawo, na lisanduku lya lilaghano lya IMNDEWA, ling'ali liwawinza kuchughu. <verse eid="JOS 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 6:9" />Na iwanu wana tsisilaha wawalongolela iwatambika iwang'ali wotowa tsimalati, aku iwabetetsi wangi wang'ali woliwinza lisanduku lya lilaghano kuchughu. Nawo wang'ali woghendelela kutsitowa tsimalati tsawo. <verse eid="JOS 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 6:10" />Yoshua kawalaghitsa iwanu kalonga, “Mleke kukemelela, wala kutowa lwangi, wala mleke kulonga chinu chochose mbaka litsuwa lyanitsowalongela, baho namwe hamtsokemelela.” <verse eid="JOS 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 6:11" />Apfo Yoshua kawatenda iwanu waghutsunguluke ghumji mala lumwe aku woliduta lisanduku lya lilaghano lya IMNDEWA, kuya woya mna tsindalo tsawo, na wakala mumo chilo chighima. <verse eid="JOS 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 6:12" />Ilupfi yake nemitondotondo Yoshua kalamka na iwatambika waduta lisanduku lya lilaghano lya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="JOS 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 6:13" />Iwatambika awala saba iwakindile tsimalati tsa membe tsa ng'olo wamale walongola hambele ha lisanduku lya lilaghano lya IMNDEWA, aku woghendelela kutowa tsimalati tsawo. Na iwanu wana tsisilaha wawalongolela iwatambika wana tsimalati, na wamwenga tsa wa kuchughu wang'ali woliwinza lisanduku. Nawo iwatambika waghendelela kutowa tsimalati tsawo. <verse eid="JOS 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 6:14" />Mna litsuwa lya keli, waghutsunguluka ghumji aghwo mala lumwe, na woya mna tsindalo tsawo. Watenda pfipfo kwa matsuwa sita. <verse eid="JOS 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 6:15" />Na mna litsuwa lya saba, walamka lupfilipfili na waghutsunguluka ghumji ghwa Yeriko ka pfawatendagha. Lekeni mna litsuwa alyo waghutsunguluka mala saba. <verse eid="JOS 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 6:16" />Hawatsunguluke lwa saba, iwatambika hawatowile tsimalati tsawo, Yoshua kawalaghitsa iwanu kalonga, “Kemeleleni kwaapfila IMNDEWA kamwing'ani ghumji aghuno. <verse eid="JOS 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 6:17" />Na ghumji aghwo ghutsohinyighwa na chila chinu ichili mumo, kwaapfila ghulapfighwa kwa IMNDEWA. Lekeni Rahabu, ipinga ayula chiweghe mumleke mghima, na iwanu wake iwali mkaye mwake, kwaapfila tsakawapfisa iwapelembi wetu watuwatumile. <verse eid="JOS 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 6:18" />Lekeni mleke kusola chinu chochose ichilapfighwe kwa IMNDEWA, kwaapfila mng'achisola mtsoitenda indalo ya Waisiraeli ilighitighighwe na ighaye. <verse eid="JOS 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 6:19" />Lekeni ifetsa, inzahabu, ishaba, na ichuma, ipfinu apfo pfienzeluka, pfitsakwikighwa pfiwe pfa IMNDEWA.” <verse eid="JOS 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 6:20" />Iwatambika watowa tsimalati, na iwanu hawahulike wakemelela kwa litsi likulu, imibanda ya ghumji ighwa ghendo. Bahala iwanu waghughendela ghumji aghwo, chila munu kulawa ahala hayemile, waghusola ghumji aghwo. <verse eid="JOS 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 6:21" />Kwa mimaghe yawo wamkoma chila munu iyali mumo, wamale, wapinga, wadodo, wabala, wang'ombe, wang'olo na pfihongwe. <verse eid="JOS 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 6:22" />Yoshua kawalongela iwanu awala weli iwaghendile kughupelemba ghumji aghwo kalonga, “Mghende mna ing'anda ya ipinga ayula ichiweghe, mlapfeni kunze na iwanu wake wose ka pfammwilahile.” <verse eid="JOS 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 6:23" />Apfo iwapelembi awala iwaghendile kupelemba ghumji aghwo waghenda wamlapfa Rahabu kunze, aba wake, mai wake, na ndughu tsake wose, wawalapfa kunze iwanu wake wose, na waweka kunze habehi na indalo ya Waisiraeli.<verse eid="JOS 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 6:24" />Waghulakatsa na moto ghumji ghwose, na chila chinu ichili mumo, lekeni ifetsa, inzahabu, ishaba, na ipfinu pfa chuma wapfika pfiwe pfa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="JOS 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 6:25" />Lekeni Yoshua kamleka mghima Rahabu, ipinga ayula chiweghe na ndughu tsake wose, kwaapfila yeye tsakawapfisa iwanu weli iyawatumile Yoshua wakaghupelembe ghumji ghwa Yeriko, na ipinga ayo chiweghe kokala na Waisiraeli mbaka leloli aino. <verse eid="JOS 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 6:26" />Matsuwa agho Yoshua kelaha, kalonga, “Imunu wowose iyatsotsenga keli ghumji aghuno ghwa Yeriko yalighitighwe hambele ha IMNDEWA. Imunu wowose iyatsotsenga ilukwalambatsa lwa ghumji aghuno imwanaghe chaudele yafe, na ayula iyatsotsenga ghamalango gha ghumji aghuno imwanaghe mtsuwanda yafe.” <verse eid="JOS 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 6:27" />Apfo IMNDEWA tsakakala hamwe na Yoshua, na ukumanyika kwa Yoshua tsakwenela isi yose.<verse eid="JOS 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOS 7" />
  <para style="s">Inzambi ya Akani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 7:1" />Lekeni Waisiraeli tsawatenda nzambi mna ipfinu ipfighomighwe ukusolighwa, kwaapfila Akani, mwana wa Karimi, na iyali mtsukukulu wa Zabidi, iyolawila mlukolo lwa Zera mna likabila lya Yuda tsakasola pfinu mna ipfinu ipfilapfighwe pfiwe pfa IMNDEWA. Apfo IMNDEWA kawaghudubukila iwanu wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="JOS 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 7:2" />Kuya Yoshua kawatuma iwanu kulawa Yeriko wagheluke waghende kuna ghumji ghwa Ai, ighuli habehi na Beti Aveni, mashariki mwa Beteli, kawalongela, “Mghende na mkaghupelembe ghumji aghwo.” Apfo iwanu waghenda na waghupelemba ghumji aghwo. <verse eid="JOS 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 7:3" />Hawoyile kwa Yoshua, walonga, “Waleke kughenda iwanu wose kughutowa ghumji ghwa Ai. Leka kuwadununza iwanu wose kwaapfila iwanu iwokala amwo wachidogho, lelo watume wanu elufu mbili au elufu ndatu.” <verse eid="JOS 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 7:4" />Apfo wanu elufu ndatu waghenda kwitowa na iwanu wa Ai, lekeni iwanu wa Ai wawawinga. <verse eid="JOS 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 7:5" />Iwanu wa Ai wawakoma Waisiraeli salasini na sita, na wawawinga walawe mna lilango lya ghumji, mbaka Shebarimu, wawakomela mna ghumhulumko. Waisiraeli waghwa chighudemo, na imimoyo yawo itenyuka ghendo. <verse eid="JOS 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 7:6" />Kuya Yoshua kadegha ghamaghwanda ghake, keghwisa hasi hambele ha lisanduku lya IMNDEWA, kakala baho mbaka nemihe, yeye na iwakulu wa Waisiraeli nawo watenda pfipfo, wose wemwaghila litimbwisi mna ghamatwi ghawo. <verse eid="JOS 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 7:7" />Yoshua kalonga, “Ghwe IMNDEWA Imulungu, hebali uwaghalile iwanu awano waloke ghumto ghwa Yoridani kuya utwike mna ghamoko gha Waamori watukome? Ng'apfu tung'akalile kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani! <verse eid="JOS 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 7:8" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, lelo nonge choni, Waisiraeli sambi wawingighwa na awala iwowehila! <verse eid="JOS 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 7:9" />Wakanani na iwanu wose wa isi aino hawatsohulika achino ichilawile, watsotutsila na kuleghusa litaghwa lyetu muisi lihupe. Lelo litaghwa lyako kulu utsolitendatse?”<verse eid="JOS 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 7:10" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Yoshua, “Winuke! Heule wighwisile hasi apfino? <verse eid="JOS 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 7:11" />Waisiraeli watenda nzambi, ng'awakindile baye lilaghano lyangu lyaniwalaghitse walikinde, wasola pfinu mna ipfinu ipfighomighwe ukusolighwa, wapfiba na waghutsuka, wapfipfisa na wapfihanganya hamwe na ipfinu pfawo. <verse eid="JOS 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 7:12" />Apfo Waisiraeli ng'awodaha baye kwitowa na iwanu awala iwowehila, wohunduka na kutsuma kwaapfila wawo wenyegho wahighighwa wakomighwe. Nene sitsokala namwe keli baye mbaka mchihinye ichinu achila chaniwaghomile mleke kuchisola. <verse eid="JOS 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 7:13" />Lelo winuke! Uwatende iwanu wele, uwalongele wetende wele iwenyegho, na wakale ghoya kwa ilupfi, kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wawo, Imulungu wa Isiraeli kolonga, ‘Mna ipfinu pfenu mna pfinu ipfighomighwe ukusolighwa. Apfo ng'amdaha ghendo baye ukuwatowa iwanu iwowehila mbaka mpfilapfe. <verse eid="JOS 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 7:14" />Nemitondo wose mtsakutsa hambele hangu kabila kwa kabila, likabila ilisaghulighwa na IMNDEWA litsoseghela hambele, mtsakutsa lukolo kwa lukolo, na ilukolo ilutsosaghulighwa na IMNDEWA lutsoseghela hambele kaye imweimwe, na ikaye itsosaghulighwa na IMNDEWA iseghele hambele munu yumwe yumwe. <verse eid="JOS 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 7:15" />Imunu ayula iyoghoghighwa na ipfinu ipfighomighwe ukusolighwa, ayo yalakatsighwe mbaka yafe, na ipfinu pfake pfose pfayali napfo, kwaapfila ng'alikindile baye lilaghano lya IMNDEWA, na katenda chinu ichighuma chinyala mna iwanu wa Isiraeli.’ ”<verse eid="JOS 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 7:16" />Nemitondotondo Yoshua kalamka, kawaghala Waisiraeli hambele kabila kwa kabila, na likabila lya Yuda lighoghighwa. <verse eid="JOS 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 7:17" />Katsighala kolo tsa Yuda hambele lukolo kwa lukolo, na ilukolo lwa Wazera lughoghighwa. Kuya katsighala tsikaye tsa Wazera hambele, kaye kwa kaye, na ikaye ya Zabudi ighoghighwa. <verse eid="JOS 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 7:18" />Kuya Yoshua kaiseghetsa hambele ikaye ya Zabudi munu yumwe yumwe, na Akani imwana wa Karimi, imwana wa Zabudi, imwana wa Zera, wa likabila lya Yuda kaghoghighwa. <verse eid="JOS 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 7:19" />Yoshua kamlongela Akani, “Mwanangu, haulonga ulongese hambele ha IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, umtunye kuya unongele aghala ghautendile, uleke kunipfisa.” <verse eid="JOS 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 7:20" />Akani kamwidika, “Nolongesa ghendo, nene nimtendela nzambi IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, na achino chicho chanendile: <verse eid="JOS 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 7:21" />Hambonile ghwanda linoghile ililawile Babeli, na pfihande miya mbili pfa fetsa, na mche ghwa nzahabu utito wake pfihande hamsini, nipfisulukila na kupfisola, nipfihimbila na kupfipfisa hasi mna ichibumbulika changu, na ifetsa ya hasi ghendo ha ipfinu apfo.” <verse eid="JOS 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 7:22" />Apfo Yoshua katuma wanu, nawo watsuma mbaka kuna ichimbumbulika cha Akani, na wapfona ipfinu apfo pfipfisighwa mna ichibumbulika chake, na ifetsa ikala hasi ghendo. <verse eid="JOS 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 7:23" />Wapfisola ipfinu apfo wamghalila Yoshua, na iwanu wose wa Isiraeli nawo wapfika hasi hambele ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="JOS 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 7:24" />Kuya Yoshua, na Waisiraeli wose wamsola Akani mwana Zera, ifetsa aila, lighwanda alila ililawile Babeli, inzahabu aila, iwanaghe wose wamale na wapinga, wang'ombe wake, wang'olo wake, pfihongwe wake, ichibumbulika chake, na ipfinu pfake pfose pfayakalile napfo, wawaghala kuna lwanda lwa Akori. <verse eid="JOS 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 7:25" />Yoshua kalonga, “Ule ghweghwe utughalile maghayo aghano ghose? IMNDEWA katsokughalila maghayo na ghweghwe leloli aino.” Na iwanu wose wamtowa na ghamabwe Akani mbaka kafa. Pfipfila wawatowa iwanu wake wose mbaka wafa na wawalakatsa kwa moto. <verse eid="JOS 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 7:26" />Kuya walunditsa mabwe mchanya mwake, na lilundo alyo lya ghamabwe lyabaho mbaka leloli aino. Baho ukughudubuka kwa IMNDEWA kuhola, na ihanu aho mbaka leloli aino hokemighwa Lwanda lwa Akori.<verse eid="JOS 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOS 8" />
  <para style="s">Ghumji ghwa Ai ghwosolighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 8:1" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Yoshua, “Uleke kupfuka wala kutenyuka ghumoyo, wasole iwanu wako wa ing'ondo wose waghende naghwe, mkaghutowe ghumji ghwa Ai, kwaapfila nikwing'a mmoko mwako imfalume wa Ai na iwanu wake, na ghumji ghwake, na isi yake. <verse eid="JOS 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 8:2" />Mtsoghuhinya ghendo ghumji ghwa Ai na imfalume wake ka pfamghuhinyile ghumji ghwa Yeriko na imfalume wake. Pfinu pfake na wanyama wake hamuwasola watsakuwa wenu. Mghende mkaghutowe ghumji kulawa ubali wa kuchughu.”<verse eid="JOS 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 8:3" />Apfo Yoshua na iwanu wake wose wa ing'ondo waghenda kughutowa ghumji ghwa Ai. Kawasaghula iwanu elufu salasini wana libapfu lya ukwitowa na kawatuma nechilo. <verse eid="JOS 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 8:4" />Kawalaghitsa, kalonga, “Tegheletseni ghoya, mwipfise ubali wa kuchughu wa ghumji, mleke kughenda kutali nagho, ila wose mkale ghoya kwa ukwitowa. <verse eid="JOS 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 8:5" />Nene na iwanu wose iwali hamwe na nene, tutsoghuseghelela habehi kughutowa, na iwanu hawatsolawa kwitowa na twetwe, ka pfawatendile aho mwanduso, twetwe tutsotsuma hambele hawo. <verse eid="JOS 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 8:6" />Nawo watsotuwinza mbaka tuwaghale kutali na ghumji ghwawo, kwaapfila watsolonga watuwinga ka pfawatuwingile aho mwanduso. Na twetwe twowaleka watuwinge. <verse eid="JOS 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 8:7" />Kuya mwemwe mtsolawa aho hamwipfisile, na kughusola ghumji. IMNDEWA Imulungu katsomwing'ani mmoko mwenu ghumji aghwo. <verse eid="JOS 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 8:8" />Hamtsoghusola ghumji, mghulakatse, mtende ka IMNDEWA pfayatulaghitse. Mlole nene nowalaghitsani.”<verse eid="JOS 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 8:9" />Apfo Yoshua kawatuma waghenda mbaka hanu aho hawatsepfisa, wakala haghati ha ghumji ghwa Ai na Beteli ubali wa maghalibi mwa ghumji ghwa Ai. Lekeni Yoshua ichilo acho tsakawasa hamwe na iwanu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="JOS 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 8:10" />Nemitondotondo Yoshua kalamka kawakema iwanu hamwe, kuya kawalongolela kagheluka, kaghenda Ai aku kelongotsa na iwanzehe wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="JOS 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 8:11" />Iwanu wose wa ing'ondo, awala iwelongotse naye, waghenda waghuseghelela habehi ghumji aghwo, weka indalo ubali wa kasikazini wa ghumji ghwa Ai, aho tsa hana lwanda haghati hawo na ghumji ghwa Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 8:12" />Yoshua kasola wanu wamale elufu tano, kawaghala wakepfise mna lwanda iuli haghati ha Beteli na Ai ubali wa maghalibi wa Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 8:13" />Wanu wengi wa ing'ondo tsawakala ubali wa kasikazini, na wamwenga wang'ali wowapfisila ubali wa maghalibi. Ichilo acho Yoshua kawasa kulwanda. <verse eid="JOS 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 8:14" />Imfalume wa Ai hayonile apfo, yeye na iwamale wose wa ghumji aghwo nemitondotondo wasumka waghenda kwitowa na Waisiraeli mna mhulumko ighughenda Araba. Lekeni ng'amanyile baye ka tsahana Waisiraeli wamwenga wakala kuchughu kwa ghumji wepfisa. <verse eid="JOS 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 8:15" />Yoshua na Waisiraeli wose wetenda ka wakuya kuchughu, na watsumila kunyika. <verse eid="JOS 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 8:16" />Iwanu wose iwang'ali wokala Ai, wakemighwa hamwe wawawinze Waisiraeli, na hawang'ali womuwinza Yoshua waghenda na waghuleka kutali ghumji ghwawo. <verse eid="JOS 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 8:17" />Kuduhu munu hata yumwe mna ghumji ghwa Ai, au ghwa Beteli, yang'aghendile kuwawinza Waisiraeli. Apfo waghuleka ghumji ghwawo mwatsi na kuwawinza Waisiraeli.<verse eid="JOS 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 8:18" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Yoshua, “Ughwinule ghumgoha ighuli mmoko mwako, ghulolese Ai, kwaapfila nokwing'a ghumji aghwo mmwoko mwako.” Naye Yoshua kagholosa ghumgoha kulolesa ghumji ghwa Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 8:19" />Baho Yoshua hayagholose ghumoko ghwake, iwanu iwang'ali wepfisa wasumka ukwinuka, watsumila mna ghumji, wengila na waghusola, baho waghulakatsa kwa moto. <verse eid="JOS 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 8:20" />Kuya iwanu wa Ai hawalolile kuchughu, wona liyosi mlanga, nawo ng'awadahile baye kutsumila aku au akula, na Waisiraeli awala iwatsumile kunyika wahunduka na wawoyila awala iwang'ali wowawinza. <verse eid="JOS 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 8:21" />Yoshua na Waisiraeli wose hawonile iwanu iwang'ali wepfisa waghusola ghumji na liyosi lyodimkila kulanga, wahunduka na kuwakoma iwanu wa Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 8:22" />Waisiraeli iwengile mna ghumji ghwa Ai nawo walawa na wahulumka kuwawinza iwanu wa Ai. Apfo iwanu wa Ai watsungulukighwa na Waisiraeli chila ubali. Waisiraeli wawakoma wose na ng'awamlekile mghima munu wowose baye. <verse eid="JOS 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 8:23" />Lekeni imfalume wa Ai wamghogha na wamleka mghima, na wamsola wamghala kwa Yoshua. <verse eid="JOS 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 8:24" />Waisiraeli hawamalitse ukuwakoma iwanu wa Ai iwakalile kunyika kwawawawingile, woya mna ghumji ghwa Ai na kukoma chila munu iyakalile mumo. <verse eid="JOS 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 8:25" />Iwanu wose wa ghumji ghwa Ai iwafile mna litsuwa alyo wamale na wapinga tsawapetighwa wapfika elufu kumi na mbili. <verse eid="JOS 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 8:26" />Yoshua ng'ahulumse baye ghumoko ghwake ighukindile ghumgoha, ighugholoke kulolesa Ai, mbaka hayamalitse ukuwakoma iwanu wose wa Ai. <verse eid="JOS 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 8:27" />Waisiraeli wesolela wenyegho ipfinu na wanyama ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse Yoshua. <verse eid="JOS 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 8:28" />Apfo Yoshua kaghulakatsa ghumji ghwa Ai na kaghutenda ghuwe mahame mbaka leloli aino. <verse eid="JOS 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 8:29" />Kuya wamkondeka imfalume wa Ai mna ghumbiki mbaka nemihe. Litsuwa haliswele, Yoshua kalaghitsa, nawo waluhulumsa ilukuli lwake walwasa hana lilango lya ukwingilila ghumji. Weka lundo kulu lya mabwe mchanya mwa ilukuli lwake, na lilundo alyo lyabaho mbaka leloli aino.<verse eid="JOS 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghamalaghitso ghosomighwa mna ichidunda cha Ebali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 8:30" />Kuya Yoshua kamtsengela matsabahu IMNDEWA Imulungu wa Isiraeli kuna ichidunda cha Ebali, <verse eid="JOS 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 8:31" />ka Musa imtumwa wa IMNDEWA pfayawalaghitse Waisiraeli. Katsenga kwa kuwinza achila ichandikighwe mna ichitabu cha malaghitso gha Musa, imatsabahu itsotsengighwa kwa mabwe ing'aghasongolighwe na chinu cha chuma. Na mchanya mwa imatsabahu ayo wamlapfila IMNDEWA nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa na nambiko tsa ukukala tseghamba. <verse eid="JOS 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 8:32" />Na baho, aku Waisiraeli wose wolola, Yoshua kaghandika keli ghamalaghitso gha Musa mchanya mwa mabwe. <verse eid="JOS 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 8:33" />Waisiraeli wose, iwanzehe wose, iwagheni wose, iwakulu wawo na walamlitsi tsawema chila ubali wa lisanduku lya lilaghano lya IMNDEWA hambele ha iwatambika Walawi iwadutile lisanduku lya lilaghano lya IMNDEWA. Wamwenga tsawema hambele ha ichidunda cha Gerizimu na wangi tsawema hambele ha chidunda cha Ebali, ka Musa imtumighwa wa IMNDEWA pfayawalaghitse aho mwanduso Waisiraeli pfawatsobalikighwa. <verse eid="JOS 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 8:34" />Kuya Yoshua kawasomela ghose ighali mna ghamalaghitso, tsibalaka na malighito, ka pfayandikighwe mna ichitabu cha malaghitso. <verse eid="JOS 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 8:35" />Chila laghitso lyayalaghitse Musa, Yoshua kawasomela Waisiraeli wose iwetingane hamwe, iwapinga, iwana na iwagheni iwakalile nawo.<verse eid="JOS 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOS 9" />
  <para style="s">Wagibioni womghutsukila Yoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 9:1" />Iwafalume wose iwakalile kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani mna isi ina ipfidunda na mna ichiwala chose, mbaka kumwani mwa ibahari ya Mediteraniya ilolesa Lebanoni, Wahiti, Waamori, Wakanani, Waperizi, Wahivi, na Wayebusi, hawahulike mbuli tsa Waisiraeli, <verse eid="JOS 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 9:2" />wetingana hamwe, ili wetowe na Yoshua na Waisiraeli.<verse eid="JOS 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 9:3" />Lekeni iwanu wa Gibioni hawahulike achila chayatendile Yoshua kuna isi ya Yeriko na Ai, <verse eid="JOS 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 9:4" />walamla kumbugha Yoshua. Apfo wamwenga wawo wetenda ka wasenga, weka ipfijo pfawo, wawatwika wapfihongwe wawo maghunila ghalalile, na mikoba ya ngotsi ilalile ya kwikila imbwali, ideghekedegheke na kudadatsighwa. <verse eid="JOS 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 9:5" />Mmaghulu mwawo wapfala mikwabatsa ilalile na idadatsighwe, na wapfala magwanda ghalalile, na ipfijo pfawo pfose pfisakala na pfipfughuya. <verse eid="JOS 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 9:6" />Wamghendela Yoshua ako Giligali, Waisiraeli kwawekile indalo yawo, wamlongela yeye na wanu wa Isiraeli, “Twetwe twolawa isi ya kutali, twobama mwemwe mwilaghane na twetwe.” <verse eid="JOS 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 9:7" />Kuya iwanu wa Isiraeli wawalongela awo Wahivi, “Tudahatse kwilaghana namwe songaha mwemwe mwokala habehi na twetwe?” <verse eid="JOS 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 9:8" />Wamlongela Yoshua, “Twetwe twa watumwa wako.” Kuya Yoshua kawaghutsa, “Mwemwe mli tsina nani na mlawila kwani?”<verse eid="JOS 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 9:9" />Wamwidika, “Twetwe twa watumwa wako yatulawile isi ya kutali tutsa ahano kwaapfila tuhulika ukulu wa IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu, na tuhulika ukumanyika kwake na ghose ghayatendile akula Misiri, <verse eid="JOS 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 9:10" />na tuhulika aghala ghose ghayatendile kwa iwafalume weli wa Waamori iwakalile kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani, mfalume Sihoni wa Heshiboni na mfalume Ogi wa Bashani iyalongotse isi ya Ashitaloti. <verse eid="JOS 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 9:11" />Iwakulu wetu na iwanu wose iwokala mna isi yetu watulongela, tusole imau ya ghumwanza, tutse twitingane namwe na tuwalongele twetwe twa watumwa wenu, apfo mwilaghane na twetwe. <verse eid="JOS 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 9:12" />Mlole lelo imau yetu tsaing'ali yosoma hatulawile ukaye kutsa kuna mwemwe, lelo sambi isakala na ipfughuya. <verse eid="JOS 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 9:13" />Imikoba yatumemese idipfai tsamighima, lelo mlole sambi itulika. Imakwabatsa yetu na maghwanda ghetu ghalala kwaapfila tulawa isi ya kutali.”<verse eid="JOS 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 9:14" />Apfo, Waisiraeli wasola ipfijo pfawo, lekeni ng'awabamile baye kumghutsa IMNDEWA choni chakutenda. <verse eid="JOS 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 9:15" />Apfo Yoshua keka lilaghano lya ukukala tseghamba na iwanu wa Gibeoni, na laghano lya ukuwaleka Wagibeoni waghima. Na pfilongotsi wa Isiraeli welighita ghendo ka watsokinda lilaghano alyo.<verse eid="JOS 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 9:16" />Matsuwa madatu haghamalile kulawa hawekile lilaghano alyo na Wagidioni, Waisiraeli tsawamanya iwanu awo wang'ali wokala habehi nawo. <verse eid="JOS 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 9:17" />Apfo Waisiraeli wanza ghumwanza na mna litsuwa lya kadatu wapfika mna imiji yawo. Imiji ayo iyo aino: ghumji ghwa Gibeoni, ghwa Kefira, ghwa Beeroti na ghwa Kiriati Yearimu. <verse eid="JOS 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 9:18" />Lekeni Waisiraeli ng'awawakomile baye, kwaapfila pfilongotsi wa Waisiraeli tsawelaha kwa taghwa lya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, ka wang'awalekile waghima. Apfo iwanu wose wawanung'unikila pfilongotsi wawo. <verse eid="JOS 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 9:19" />Lekeni pfilongotsi wawo wawedika, “Tsatwilighita kwa taghwa lya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli ka tung'awalekile waghima, apfo sambi ng'atudaha baye kuwakoma. <verse eid="JOS 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 9:20" />Tutsowatendela apfino, tutsowaleka wawe waghima, ili imaya ya Imulungu ileke kutuyila twetwe kwa kuleka kulikinda lighito lyatwikile nawo.”<verse eid="JOS 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 9:21" />Waghendelela kulonga, “Walekeni waghima, lekeni ing'onde yawo itsakuwa kututulila tsingodi na kutughalila ghamatsi,” ka pfilongotsi wa Isiraeli pfawalongile. <verse eid="JOS 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 9:22" />Kuya Yoshua kawakema Wagibeoni na kawalongela, “Ule mwemwe mtughutsukila ahala hamlongile mwolawila isi ya kutali, kumbe mwokala habehi na twetwe? <verse eid="JOS 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 9:23" />Mwemwe sambi mlighitighwa, matsuwa ghose mwemwe mtsakuwa watumwa wetu, mtsoitulila tsingodi na kuighalila ghamatsi ing'anda ye Imulungu.” <verse eid="JOS 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 9:24" />Wamwidika Yoshua, “Tsawatulongela ghendo ka Imulungu wenu tsakamlaghitsa imtumwa wake Musa yawakome iwanu wose wa isi aino na kuweng'ani mwemwe isi aino iwe yenu ghendo. Apfo tsatupfuka ukufa na tutenda apfino. <verse eid="JOS 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 9:25" />Twetwe sambi twammoko mwako. Ututendele chochose chaukwona chinogha.”<verse eid="JOS 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 9:26" />Apfo Yoshua kawakombola Wagibeoni kulawa mna ghamoko gha Waisiraeli waleke kukomighwa. <verse eid="JOS 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 9:27" />Tsuwa lilyo Yoshua kaweng'a ing'onde ya kuwatulila tsingondi na kuwadeghela ghamatsi Waisiraeli wose, na kuideghela ghamatsi imatsabahu ya IMNDEWA, hanu hohose hayosaghula, na wosang'ana ng'onde ayo mbaka leloli aino.<verse eid="JOS 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOS 10" />
  <para style="s">Waamori wotowighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 10:1" />Mfalume Adoni Sedeki wa Yerusalemu kahulika Yoshua pfayaghusolile ghumji ghwa Ai na kughuhinya ghendo na kumkoma imfalume wake, ka pfayaghuhinyile ghumji ghwa Yeriko na kumkoma imfalume wake. Pfipfila kahulika iwanu wa Gibeoni pfawekile laghano lya ukukala tseghamba na Waisiraeli, na pfawokala hamwe nawo. <verse eid="JOS 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 10:2" />Apfo yeye na iwanu wake wa Yerusalemu tsawengilighwa na wogha, kwaapfila Gibeoni tsaghukala mji ighumanyike mna imiji ya chifalume. Pfipfila tsaghukala mji mkulu kubita mji ghwa Ai, na iwanu wake tsawadaha kwitowa pfinoghile. <verse eid="JOS 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 10:3" />Apfo mfalume Adoni Sedeki wa Yerusalemu katuma nume kwa mfalume Hohamu wa Heburoni, mfalume Piramu wa Yarimuti, mfalume Yafia wa Lakishi na mfalume Debili wa Egiloni, kawalongela, <verse eid="JOS 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 10:4" />“Mtse mnyapfile tuwatowe Wagibeoni, kwaapfila weka laghano lya ukukala tseghamba na Yoshua na Waisiraeli.” <verse eid="JOS 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 10:5" />Iwafalume awo watano wa Waamori: mfalume wa Yerusalemu, mfalume wa Heburoni, mfalume wa Yarimuti, mfalume wa Lakishi, na mfalume wa Egiloni, wawatinganitsa hamwe iwanu wawo wa ing'ondo, kuya wagheluka na wanu wawo wa ing'ondo mbaka Gibeoni, waghutsingila ghumji aghwo na kughutowa ghendo. <verse eid="JOS 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 10:6" />Wagibeoni wawatuma iwanu kwa Yoshua ako Giligali kwawekile indalo, wamlongela apfino, “Dedede Yoshua uleke kutuleka twetwe iwatumwa wako, utse sambi baha utwapfile na utukombole kwaapfila wafalume wose wa Waamori iwolawa mna isi tsa ipfidunda wawatinganitsa iwanu wawo wa ing'ondo na watsa kututowa.”<verse eid="JOS 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 10:7" />Baho Yoshua na iwanu wake wose, na awala iwodaha kwitowa sideke woka Giligali. <verse eid="JOS 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 10:8" />IMNDEWA Imulungu kamlongela Yoshua, “Uleke kuwapfuka, kwaapfila nitsokwapfila kuwatowa, wala kuduhu munu wowose iyodaha kwima yetowe na ghweghwe.” <verse eid="JOS 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 10:9" />Yoshua kanga chilo chose kulawa Giligali, kawatowa kwa kuwedukitsa. <verse eid="JOS 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 10:10" />IMNDEWA Imulungu kawaghuma wogha hambele ha Waisiraeli, Nawo wakoma iwanu wengi ako Gibeoni. Waisiraeli wawawinga, nawo watsumila kuna inzila igheluka Beti Horoni na watsuma mbaka mna ghumhulumko ghughenda nzila ya Azeka na Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 10:11" />Hawang'ali wotsuma kuwahepa Waisiraeli mna ghumhulumko ghwa Beti Horoni, IMNDEWA Imulungu kawaghalila mvula ng'ulu ya mabwe makulu kulawa kulanga iwatowele hawang'ali wamnzila. Iwanu iwafile kwa imvula ayo ya ghamabwe tsawawengi kubita awala iwakomighwe na limaghe na Waisiraeli. <verse eid="JOS 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 10:12" />Baho Yoshua kalonga na IMNDEWA mna litsuwa alyo IMNDEWA hayawekile Waamori mna ghamoko gha Waisiraeli, tsakalonga hambele ha iwanu wa Isiraeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:12">“Ghwe litsua wime mna isi ya Gibeoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:12">na mwetsi ghwime mna ulwanda wa Aiyaloni.”<verse eid="JOS 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 10:13" />Apfo litsua tsalima na ghumwetsi tsaghwima mbaka Waisiraeli wose wawatowa awala iwowehila. Ka pfayandikighwe mna ichitabu cha Yashari.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:13">Litsua tsalima haghatighati ha lilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:13">na ng'alighendile baye kutsama ka kwa tsua ghima. <verse eid="JOS 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 10:14" />Litsuwa ka alyo ng'ana lilawile baye wala kwoneka keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOS 10:14">IMNDEWA Imulungu pfayamtegheletse apfo imunu. Kwaapfila IMNDEWA Imulungu imwenyegho tsakawatowela Waisiraeli. <verse eid="JOS 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 10:15" />Kuya Yoshua na iwanu wake woya kuna indalo ako Giligali.<verse eid="JOS 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshua kowakoma wafalume watano wa Waamori</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 10:16" />Wafalume awano watano wa Waamori tsawatsuma, waghenda kwipfisa mna imango ya Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 10:17" />Yoshua tsakahulika ka wafalume watano woneka wepfisa mna imango ya Makeda. <verse eid="JOS 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 10:18" />Kalonga, “Mbimbilise mambwe makulu hana ghumlomo ghwa imango ayo, kuya mwike iwanu wabetetse. <verse eid="JOS 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 10:19" />Lekeni mwemwe mleke kukala aho, muwakoleletse awala iwowehila, muwatowe iwali kuchughu kwawo, mleke kuwaleka wengile mna imiji yawo, kwaapfila IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu katsomwapfilani ukuwakoma.” <verse eid="JOS 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 10:20" />Apfo Yoshua na Waisiraeli wawakoma ghendo iwanu wose, na awala chidogho iwatsumile mna imiji yawo itsungulusighwe ubanda tsawahona. <verse eid="JOS 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 10:21" />Apfo iwanu wose wa ing'ondo woya tseghamba kwa Yoshua ako Makeda kuna indalo. Na kuduhu munu iyaghetsile kulonga chinu chochose ichihile kwa Waisiraeli. <verse eid="JOS 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 10:22" />Kuya Yoshua kalonga, “Mpfughule ghumlomo ghwa imango, na mngalile wafalume awo watano.” <verse eid="JOS 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 10:23" />Imango ipfughulighwa, wamghalila Yoshua wafalume awo watano: mfalume wa Yerusalemu, mfalume wa Heburoni, mfalume wa Yamuti, mfalume wa Lakishi na mfalume wa Egiloni. <verse eid="JOS 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 10:24" />Na hawamghalile iwafalume awo, Yoshua kawakema Waisiraeli wose na wakulu wose wa ing'ondo iwelongotse naye, kawalongela, “Mseghele ahano na mwike maghulu ghenu msingo mwa iwafalume awano.” Nawo iwakulu wa ing'ondo waseghela na wawabajugha msingo. <verse eid="JOS 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 10:25" />Yoshua kawalongela, “Mleke kupfuka, wala kutenyuka, na mghangamale, kwaapfila apfi pfipfo IMNDEWA pfayatsowatenda awala wose iwowehila hamtsetowa nawo.” <verse eid="JOS 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 10:26" />Kuya Yoshua kawakoma na kawakondeka mna mibiki mitano, na wang'ali wolebela mna imibiki ayo mbaka nemihe. <verse eid="JOS 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 10:27" />Litsua haliswele, Yoshua kalaghitsa wahulumsighwe mchanya mwa imibiki, na wawasa mna imango iwakalile wepfisa, na hana ghumlomo ghwa imango weka mabwe makulu, na ghamabwe agho ghabaho mbaka leloli aino.<verse eid="JOS 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshua koisola imiji ya kusini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 10:28" />Litsua alyo Yoshua hayaghusolile ghumji ghwa Makeda, tsakamkoma mfalume wake na chila munu iyakalile mumo, ng'alekile munu baye, kamtendela mfalume wa Makeda ka pfayamtendele imfalume wa Yeriko. <verse eid="JOS 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 10:29" />Kuya Yoshua na Waisiraeli wose walawa Makeda na waghenda kuna ghumji ghwa Libina na waghutowa. <verse eid="JOS 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 10:30" />IMNDEWA kaweng'a ghumji aghwo na imfalume wake mna ghamoko gha Waisiraeli, wawakoma iwanu wose na ng'awalekile baye munu wowose. Wamtendela mfalume wa Libina ka pfawamtendele mfalume wa Yeriko. <verse eid="JOS 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 10:31" />Kuya Yoshua na Waisiraeli wose walawa Libina waghenda Lakishi, waghutsunguluka na waghutowa. <verse eid="JOS 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 10:32" />IMNDEWA kaweng'a ghumji aghwo mna ghamoko gha Waisiraeli, na Yoshua kaghusola ghumji agho mna litsua lya keli, kawakoma iwanu wose ka pfayatendile akula Libina. <verse eid="JOS 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 10:33" />Baho, mfalume Horamu wa Gezeri tsakatsa kuwapfila iwanu wa Lakishi, lekeni Yoshua kamtowa yeye na iwanu wake, na ng'alekile munu wowose baye. <verse eid="JOS 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 10:34" />Kuya Yoshua na Waisiraeli wose walawa Lakishi waghenda Egiloni, waghutsunguluka na waghutowa. <verse eid="JOS 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 10:35" />Waghusola mna litsua lilyo, na kuwakoma iwanu wake wose ka pfayatendile akula Lakishi. <verse eid="JOS 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 10:36" />Kuya Yoshua na Waisiraeli wose walawa kuna ghumji ghwa Egiloni wagheluka kuna ghumji ghwa Heburoni, nawo waghutowa, <verse eid="JOS 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 10:37" />waghusola, na wawakoma iwanu wake wose na imfalume wake, wahinya kaye tsose itsili habehi na kukoma chila munu ka pfawatendile akula Egiloni. <verse eid="JOS 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 10:38" />Kuya Yoshua na Waisiraeli wose woya kuna ghumji ghwa Debili na kughutowa. <verse eid="JOS 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 10:39" />Waghusola ghumji aghwo, mfalume wake na miji yose ighutsunguluke, na kukoma chila munu iyakalile amwo, ng'awalekile munu baye. Waghutendela ghumji aghwo ghwa Debili na mfalume wake ka pfawatendile akula Heburoni na Libina na wafalume wawo. <verse eid="JOS 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 10:40" />Apfo Yoshua kasola isi yose, kawatowa wafalume wose wa isi tsa ipfidunda, Negebu, mna ipfiwala, na mna imihulumko na wafalume wawo wose, ng'alekile chinu chochose baye china ughima, kakoma wose ka IMNDEWA Imulungu wa Isiraeli pfayamlaghitse. <verse eid="JOS 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 10:41" />Yoshua kawatowa mala lumwe iwanu wose kulawa Kadeshi Barinea mbaka Gaza na kulawa Gosheni mbaka Gibeoni. <verse eid="JOS 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 10:42" />Yoshua kawatowa wafalume awano wose na isi tsawo, kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli tsakawapfila Waisiraeli. <verse eid="JOS 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 10:43" />Kuya Yoshua koya na Waisiraeli wose ako Giligali kwawalongole kukala.<verse eid="JOS 10:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOS 11" />
  <para style="s">Yoshua kowatowa wafalume wa kasikazini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 11:1" />Mfalume Yabini wa ghumji ghwa Hazori hayahulike apfo, katuma wanu waghende kwa mfalume Yobabu wa isi ya Madoni, na kwa mfalume wa ghumji ghwa Shimroni na ghumji ghwa Akishafi, <verse eid="JOS 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 11:2" />na kwa wafalume iwakalile mna ipfindunda pfa kasikazini, na Araba ubali wa kusini mwa Kinereti, na mna ichiwala cha Nafati Dori iili ubali wa maghalibi. <verse eid="JOS 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 11:3" />Pfipfila katuma kwa Wakanaani iwakalile ubali wa maghalibi, na kwa Waamori, Wahiti, Waperizi, Wayebusi iwakalile kupfidunda, na Wahivi iwakalile kuhisi mwa chidunda Herimoni ili mna isi ya Misipa. <verse eid="JOS 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 11:4" />Apfo, watsa na iwanu wawo wose wa ing'ondo, tsawawengi ka msanga ighuli kumwani, tsawatsa na mituka mingi ikweghighwa na falasi, na tsawatsa na falasi wengi. <verse eid="JOS 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 11:5" />Wafalume awano wose, na iwanu wawo tsawetingana hamwe na weka indalo yawo hana imbwibwi ya Meromu, wetowe na Waisiraeli.<verse eid="JOS 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 11:6" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Yoshua, “Uleke kuwapfuka, ilupfi masaa ka aghano nitsowakoma na kukwing'a mmoko mwako, mtsowaghana iminyughe ye imighulu wafalasi wawo na mtsolakatsa imituka yawo.” <verse eid="JOS 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 11:7" />Apfo Yoshua na iwanu wake wose wa ing'ondo waghenda kwa kuwedukitsa na kuwatowa hane imbibwi ya Meromu. <verse eid="JOS 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 11:8" />IMNDEWA kaweka mna ghamwoko gha Waisiraeli, nawo wawatowa wawawinga na watsumila nzila ighenda Sidoni Ng'ulu na Misirefoti Maimu, mbaka kupfikila ulwanda lwa Misipa ubali wa mashariki, na kuduhu munu iyalekighwe mghima. <verse eid="JOS 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 11:9" />Yoshua kawatendela ka IMNDEWA pfayamlongele, kawaghana iminyughe mna imighulu wafalasi wawo na kailakatsa imituka yawo ikweghighwa na wafalasi. <verse eid="JOS 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 11:10" />Yoshua hayang'ali yakuya, kaghusola ghumji ghwa Hazori, kamkoma imfalume wake, kwaapfila ghumji ghwa Hazori aho ghumwande tsa ghugho ghumji mkulu ghwa tsifalume atso tsose. <verse eid="JOS 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 11:11" />Wamkoma chila munu iyakalile mumo, kuduhu munu iyakalile mghima, na waghulakatsa ghumji agh ghwa Hazori. <verse eid="JOS 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 11:12" />Pfipfila Yoshua kaisola imiji yose aila iyaighoghile, na kawakoma wafalume wake wose, ka Musa imtumwa wa IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse. <verse eid="JOS 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 11:13" />Waisiraeli ng'awailakatse baye imiji ikalile mpfidunda pfa ghamahame ghawo, ila ghumji ghwa Hazori ghuliyeka ghugho ghwayalakatse Yoshua. <verse eid="JOS 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 11:14" />Waisiraeli wesolela wenyegho chila chinu, na iwanyama iwakalile mna imiji ayo. Lekeni wawakoma iwanu wose iwakalile mumo, ng'awamlekile baye munu wowose yawe mghima. <verse eid="JOS 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 11:15" />Ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse imtumighwa wake Musa, pfipfo Musa naye kamlaghitsa Yoshua, Yoshua naye katenda pfipfo ka pfayalaghitsighwe. Katenda chila chinu ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse Musa.<verse eid="JOS 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsiisi tsayabokile Yoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 11:16" />Apfo Yoshua kaisola isi yose, isi ya ipfidunda, isi ya Negebu, isi yose ya Gosheni, isi ya Shefala, na pfidunda pfa Isiraeli na isi tsake tsili mpfiwala. <verse eid="JOS 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 11:17" />Kulawa chidunda cha Halaki, ichighenda Seiri, mbaka Baali Gadi mna ulwanda wa Lebanoni hasi ha chidunda cha Herimoni, kawaghogha wafalume wose, kawatowa na kuwakoma. <verse eid="JOS 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 11:18" />Yoshua tsaketowa na wafalume awano wose kwa matsuwa mengi. <verse eid="JOS 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 11:19" />Kuduhu mji ghoghose ghungi ghwikile laghano lya ukukala tseghamba na Waisiraeli ila awala Wahivi iwokala Gibeoni, aghwo ng'awaghutowile baye. Lekeni imiji ingi yose tsawaisola kwa ukwitowa. <verse eid="JOS 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 11:20" />IMNDEWA mwenyegho yuyo yawatendile wawe wasughu wetowe na Waisiraeli, tsakabama waleke kwonelighwa libatsi ila wakomighwe ghendo. Apfo pfipfo IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse Musa. <verse eid="JOS 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 11:21" />Matsuwa agho Yoshua kaghenda kuwatowa Waanaki iwang'ali wokala mna pfidunda pfa Heburoni, Debili na Anabu, kulawa isi yose ya ipfidunda pfa Yuda, na kulawa isi yose ya ipfidunda ya Isiraeli. Yoshua kawatowa na kuihinya imiji yawo. <verse eid="JOS 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 11:22" />Tsakuduhu Waanaki iwakalile mna isi ya Waisiraeli, ila tsawasighala chidogho mna isi ya Gaza na Ashidodi. <verse eid="JOS 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 11:23" />Apfo Yoshua kasola isi yose ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse Musa, na kaweng'a isi ayo Waisiraeli iwe yawo, kuya kaighola isi ayo kwa chila kabila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 11:23">Apfo iwanu iwali muisi wakala bila ukwitowa.<verse eid="JOS 11:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOS 12" />
  <para style="s">Wafalume iyawatowile Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 12:1" />Awano wawo iwafalume wa isi iwatowighwe na Waisiraeli na kusola isi tsawo itsikalile kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani ubali wa mashariki, kulawa lwanda lwa ghumto ghwa Arinoni mbaka chidunda cha Herimoni na isi yose ya Araba ubali wa mashariki. <verse eid="JOS 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 12:2" />Mfalume Sihoni wa Waamori, iyakalile Heshiboni, iyalongotse kulawa isi ya Aroeri, isi ikalile mmbalimbali mwa lwanda lwa Arinoni. Tsakalongotsa kulawa haghatighati ha lwanda lwa Arinoni mbaka ghumto ghwa Yaboki ighuli mbaka ghwa isi ya Waamoni, inusu ya isi ya Gileadi. <verse eid="JOS 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 12:3" />Pfipfila tsakalongotsa isi yose ya Araba, kulawa bahari ya Kinereti, ubali wa mashaliki, mbaka Beti Yeshimoti kuna ibahari ya Munyu, ighendelela mbaka kuna ichidunda cha Pisiga. <verse eid="JOS 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 12:4" />Pfipfila tsakamtowa mfalume wa Ogi wa isi ya Bashani, yumwe wa Warefai iyakalile mghima, iyalongotse ghumji ghwa Ashitaroti na ghumji ghwa Edirei. <verse eid="JOS 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 12:5" />Yeye tsakalongotsa mna ichidunda cha Herimoni, na ghumji ghwa Saleka, Bashani yose mbaka kuna iwanu wa ghumji ghwa Geshuri na ghumji ghwa Wamaaka, na inusu ya Gileadi mbaka kwaibakane na isi ya mfalume Sihoni wa Heshiboni. <verse eid="JOS 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 12:6" />Musa imtumwa wa IMNDEWA, na Waisiraeli tsawawatowa wafalume awo. Musa imtumwa wa IMNDEWA kaweng'a isi tsawo tsiwe tsa Warubeni, Wagadi na inusu ya likabila lya Manase.<verse eid="JOS 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wafalume iwatowighwe na Yoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 12:7" />Awano wawo iwafalume wa isi iwawatowighwe na Yoshua na Waisiraeli, iwakalile ubali wa maghalibi wa ghumto Yoridani, kulawa Baali Gadi mna ilwanda lwa Lebanoni mbaka chidunda cha Halaki ichili habehi na Seiri. Yoshua kawagholela ghamakabila gha Isiraeli isi atso tsiwe tsawo ghendo. <verse eid="JOS 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 12:8" />Isi atso tsimwenga tsa isi tsa pfidunda, tsa pfiwala, tsa Araba, na tsa mihulumko ya ipfidunda na atsila itsikalile mna inyika, Negebu, isi tsa Wahiti, Waamori, Wakanaani, Waperizi, Wahivi na Wayebusi. <verse eid="JOS 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 12:9" />Wafalume iwatowighwe na Waisiraeli iwo wano: mfalume wa Yeriko, mfalume wa Ai, ghumji aghwo ghwa habehi na Beteli, <verse eid="JOS 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 12:10" />mfalume wa Yerusalemu, mfalume wa Heburoni, <verse eid="JOS 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 12:11" />mfalume wa Yarimuti, mfalume wa Lakishi, <verse eid="JOS 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 12:12" />mfalume wa Egiloni, mfalume wa Gezeri, <verse eid="JOS 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 12:13" />mfalume wa Debili, mfalume wa Gederi, <verse eid="JOS 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 12:14" />mfalume wa Horima, mfalume wa Aradi, <verse eid="JOS 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 12:15" />mfalume wa Libina, mfalume wa Adulamu, <verse eid="JOS 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 12:16" />mfalume wa Makeda, mfalume wa Beteli, <verse eid="JOS 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 12:17" />mfalume wa Tapua, mfalume wa Heferi, <verse eid="JOS 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 12:18" />mfalume wa Afeka, mfalume wa Lasharoni, <verse eid="JOS 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 12:19" />mfalume wa Madoni, mfalume wa Hazori, <verse eid="JOS 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 12:20" />mfalume wa Shimroni Meroni, mfalume wa Akishafu, <verse eid="JOS 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 12:21" />mfalume wa Taanaki, mfalume wa Megido, <verse eid="JOS 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 12:22" />mfalume wa Kadeshi, mfalume wa Yokineamu, ghumji aghwo tsa ghwa mna ichidunda cha Karimeli, <verse eid="JOS 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 12:23" />mfalume wa Dori, ghumji ighuli mna isi ya Nafati Dori, mfalume wa Goiimu ako Giligali, na <verse eid="JOS 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 12:24" />mfalume wa Tiriza. Wafalume awo wose tsawapfika salasini na yumwe.<verse eid="JOS 12:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOS 13" />
  <para style="s">Tsiisi itsing'ali kusolighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 13:1" />Yoshua hayalalile, na miyaka yake kupfosa, IMNDEWA Imulungu kamlongela, “Ghweghwe kulala, na kuna isi ng'ulu ng'ana tsisolighwe baye. <verse eid="JOS 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 13:2" />Natso tsitso atsino: isi yose ya Wafilisti na isi yose ya Wageshuri. <verse eid="JOS 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 13:3" />Kulawa ghumto ghwa Shihori ibakana na Misiri mbaka Ekironi yose ili ubali wa kusini, isi ayo tsaimanyika ya Wakanaani. Isi tsose tsa wafalume watano wa Ufilisiti tsitso atsino: Gaza, Ashidodi, Ashikeloni, Gati na Ekironi mbaka isi ya Avi. <verse eid="JOS 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 13:4" />Ubali wa kusini, isi tsose tsa Wakanani kulawa Ara ya Wasidoni mbaka Afeka kuna ghumbaka ghwa Waamori. <verse eid="JOS 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 13:5" />Pfipfila na isi ya Gebali na ubali wa mashariki wa Lebanoni yose, kulawa Baali Gadi hasi ha chidunda cha Herimoni mbaka Lebo Hamati. <verse eid="JOS 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 13:6" />Na iwanu wose iwokala mna ipfidunda kulawa Lebanoni mbaka Misirefoti Maimu, isi yawokala Wasidoni wose. Waisiraeli pfawoghendelela kuseghela hambele mna tsiisi atso, nene mwenyegho nitsowawinga hambele ha Waisiraeli wose. Lekeni ghweghwe uwagholele Waisiraeli isi ayo iwe yawo, ka pfanikulaghitse. <verse eid="JOS 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 13:7" />Pfipfila ughagholele ghamakabila ghangi tisa na inusu ya likabila lya Manase, nawo wahale isi ayo.”<verse eid="JOS 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi ili mashariki ya Yoridani yogholighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 13:8" />Likabila lya Rubeni na Gadi na inusu imwe ya likabila lya Manase wawo wabokela isi iyaweng'ile Musa imtumighwa wa IMNDEWA, ili ubali wa mashariki mwa ghumto Yoridani. <verse eid="JOS 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 13:9" />Isi ayo yanzila kuna ghumji ghwa Aroeli mmbalimbali mwa ilwanda lwa Arinoni, na ghumji aghula ighuli mlwanda, na isi aila yose ya chiwala iyanzile kuna ghumji ghwa Madeba mbaka Diboni, <verse eid="JOS 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 13:10" />na imiji yose ya mfalume Sihoni wa Waamori, iyalongotse ako Heshiboni mbaka kwawebakane na Waamoni. <verse eid="JOS 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 13:11" />Hamwe na isi ya Gileadi, na isi ya Wageshuri na Wamaakati, na chidunda cha Herimoni na isi yose ya Bashani mbaka isi ya Saleka. <verse eid="JOS 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 13:12" />Na isi yose iyalongotse mfalume Ogi, yumwe wa Warefai iyakalile mghima, iyailongotse Ashitaroti na Edirei mna isi ya Bashani. Musa tsakawatowa na kasola isi tsawo. <verse eid="JOS 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 13:13" />Hata apfo Waisiraeli ng'awawawingile baye iwanu wa Geshuri na Wamaaka, ila waghendelela kukala na Waisiraeli mbaka leloli aino. <verse eid="JOS 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 13:14" />Musa ng'aweng'ile baye iwanu wa likabila la Lawi isi yoyose iwe yawo, ila wawo tsawamlapfila nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa IMNDEWA Imulungu wa Isiraeli, atso tsitso tsiisi tsaweng'ighwe, ka IMNDEWA pfayawalongele.<verse eid="JOS 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsiisi tsaweng'ighwe iwanu wa kabila lya Rubeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 13:15" />Atsino tsitso tsiisi Musa tsayaweng'ile iwanu wa likabila lya Rubeni, kwa kulola tsikolo tsawo pfatsili: <verse eid="JOS 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 13:16" />tsawebakana kulawa ghumji ghwa Aroeli mmbalimbali mwa ilwanda lwa Arinoni na ghumji ighukalile mna ilwanda alwo, na isi yose ya ichiwala cha Madeba, <verse eid="JOS 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 13:17" />mbaka Heshiboni na imiji yake yose ikalile mna ichiwala, ghumji ghwa Diboni, ghumji ghwa Bamoti Baali, ghumji ghwa Betibaali Meoni, <verse eid="JOS 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 13:18" />ghumji ghwa Jahasa, ghumji ghwa Kedemoti na Mefaati, <verse eid="JOS 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 13:19" />ghumji ghwa Kiriatimu, ghumji ghwa Sibima, ghumji ghwa Seleti Shahari ighuli mna ichidunda ichili mna ilwanda alwo, <verse eid="JOS 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 13:20" />Beti Peori, na mihulumko ya ichidunda cha Pisiga, Beti Yeshimoti, <verse eid="JOS 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 13:21" />na imiji yose aila ya ichiwala, na isi yose ya mfalume Sihoni wa Waamori iyalongotse ako Heshiboni. Musa tsakamtowa mfalume ayuno Sihoni na wafalume wose wa isi ya Midiani, isi ya Evi, isi ya Rekemu, isi ya Suri, isi ya Huri na isi ya Reba iwamlongotsele isi atso mfalume Sihoni. <verse eid="JOS 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 13:22" />Baalamu, imwana wa Beori iyakalile mghanga, yumwe iyakomighwe na Waisiraeli. <verse eid="JOS 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 13:23" />Na ghumbaka ghwa isi ya likabila lya Rubeni tsa ubali wa maghalibi wa ghumto ghwa Yoridani. Imiji aino hamwe na pfijiji pfake iyo yaweng'ighwe iwana wa Rubeni.<verse eid="JOS 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsiisi tsaweng'ighwe iwanu wa kabila lya Gadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 13:24" />Atsino tsitso tsiisi Musa tsayaweng'ile iwanu wa likabila lya Gadi, kwa kulola tsikolo tsawo pfatsili.<verse eid="JOS 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 13:25" />Isi yao tsaibakana na isi ya Yazeri na imiji yose ya Gileadi na inusu ya isi ya Waamoni mbaka Aroeli ikalile Raba ubali wa mashariki, <verse eid="JOS 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 13:26" />na kulawa kuna ghumji ghwa Heshiboni mbaka kuna ghumji ghwa Ramati Mizipa, na kuna ghumji ghwa Betonimu, na kulawa kuna ghumji ghwa Mahanaimu mbaka kuna ghumbaka ghwa ghumji ghwa Debiri. <verse eid="JOS 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 13:27" />Pfipfila mna imiji ikalile mna ulwanda lwa ghumji ghwa Beti Haramu, ghumji ghwa Beti Nimra, ghumji ghwa Sukoti na ghumji ghwa Zafoni na isi yose ikalile ya mfalume Sihoni wa Heshiboni. Ghumbaka ghwao ghwa ubali wa maghalibi ghughendelela kuna litsimbu lya Galilaya, mbaka kuna ghumto ghwa Yoridani na kwibakana na ubali wa kusini wa bahari ya Kinereti. <verse eid="JOS 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 13:28" />Aino iyo imiji na ipfijiji pfaweng'ighwe iwanu wa likabila lya Gadi kwa kulola tsikolo tsawo pfatsili.<verse eid="JOS 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsiisi tsaweng'ighwe iwanu wa mashariki wa kabila lya Manase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 13:29" />Kuya Musa tsakaweng'a inusu ya likabila lya iwanu wa Manase isi iwe yawo, tsaweng'ighwa kwa kulola tsikolo tsawo pfatsili. <verse eid="JOS 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 13:30" />Isi yawo yanzila kuna ghumji ghwa Mahanaimu ipfika mbaka mna isi iyailongotse mfalume Ogu ikalile mna isi ya Bashani, hamwe na imiji sitini ya Yairi. <verse eid="JOS 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 13:31" />Na inusu ya isi ya Gileadi, Ashitaroti, Edirei, imiji iyang'ali yoilongotsa mfalume Ogu wa Bashani. Isi aino tsaweng'ighwa nusu ya iwana wa Makiri iyali mwana wa Manase kwa kulola tsikolo tsawo pfatsili. <verse eid="JOS 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 13:32" />Musa kaweng'a tsiisi atso itsikalile ubali wa mashariki ya Yeriko kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani tsiwe tsawo, hayang'ali kamna ichiwala cha Moabu. <verse eid="JOS 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 13:33" />Lekeni likabila lya Lawi Musa ng'aweng'ile baye isi yoyose aila, kwaapfila IMNDEWA Imulungu kawalongela wawo watsopata ipfinu apfila ipfilapfighwa na iwanu kwa IMNDEWA Imulungu wa Isiraeli.<verse eid="JOS 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOS 14" />
  <para style="s">Isi ya Kanaani yogholighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 14:1" />Atsi tsitso isi tsaweng'ighwe Waisiraeli tsiwe tsawo mna isi yose ya Kanaani. Imtambika Eleazari na Yoshua mwanaghe Nuni, na wakulu wa kolo tsa ghamakabila gha Waisiraeli, wawagholela Waisiraeli. <verse eid="JOS 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 14:2" />Isi ayo tsawagholighwa kwa kwasa simbi mchanya tsilamle ka apfila IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse Musa yaweng'e ghamakabila aghala tisa na nusu. <verse eid="JOS 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 14:3" />Musa tsakagheng'a ghamakabila aghala meli na nusu isi yawo ikalile kumwambu kwa ghumto ghwa Yoridani, lekeni Musa ng'aweng'ile baye Walawi hanu hohose hawe hawo mna isi ayo. <verse eid="JOS 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 14:4" />Yosefu tsakana wana weli, Manase na Efulemu, apfo tsaghalawila makabila meli. Lekeni Walawi ng'aweng'ighwe baye isi ayo, lekeni weng'ighwa imiji ya ukukala na mighunda ya ukudimila wanyama wawo. <verse eid="JOS 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 14:5" />Apfo Waisiraeli waighola isi ayo ka apfila IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse Musa.<verse eid="JOS 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kalebu kakwing'ighwa ghumji ghwa Heburoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 14:6" />Litsuwa limwe iwanu iwolawa mna ilukulo lwa Yuda wamghendela Yoshua ako Giligali, na Kalebu mwana wa Yefune iyakalile Mkenisiti, kamlongela Yoshua, “Ghweghwe kwomanya imbuli aila IMNDEWA iyamlongele Musa, imunu wa Imulungu, imbuli inonga nene na ikulonga ghweghwe hatukalile akula Kadeshi Barineya. <verse eid="JOS 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 14:7" />Tsanina miyaka alubaini ahala Musa imtumighwa wa IMNDEWA hayanitumile kulawa Kadeshi Barinea ng'ende nikaipelembe isi ayo. Hambuyile, nimlongela aghala ghose ghambonile ka ghumoyo ghwangu pfaghutoghole. <verse eid="JOS 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 14:8" />Lekeni wayangu wangeluke nawo wawatenda iwanu wapfuke, ila nene tsanimtegheletsa IMNDEWA, iyali Mulungu wangu. <verse eid="JOS 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 14:9" />Naye Musa kanilahila nene mna litsuwa alyo, kalonga, ‘Isi yawang'ile kwa maghulu ghako itsakuwa yako na watsukulu wako matsuwa ghose ghawatsokala, kwaapfila ghweghwe kumuwinza IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako kwa ghumoyo ghwako ghwose.’ <verse eid="JOS 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 14:10" />Lekeni lelo ulole, sambi miyaka alubaini na tano kulawa IMNDEWA hayalongile na Musa, mna ghamatsuwa aghala Waisiraeli hawang'ali wopfosa mnyika. Kulawa matsuwa agho IMNDEWA kanyika mghima na sambi nina miyaka samanini na tano. <verse eid="JOS 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 14:11" />Leloli aino ning'ali nina ngupfu ka ghamatsuwa aghala Musa hayanitumile. Na hata sambi nina ngupfu ya kughenda kwitowa na kusang'ana ng'onde yoyose aila. <verse eid="JOS 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 14:12" />Lelo ungaye isi aino ya ipfidunda IMNDEWA iyalongile na nene mna litsuwa alyo. Gweghwe ghumwenyegho kuhulika ka Waanaki tsawakala mna isi ayo ng'ulu ina imibanda, songaha IMNDEWA katsonyapfila, na nene nitsowawinga ka yeye pfayalongile.” <verse eid="JOS 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 14:13" />Yoshua kambaliki Kalebu mwana wa Yefune na kamwing'a ghumji ghwa Heburoni ghuwe ghwake. <verse eid="JOS 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 14:14" />Apfo ghumji ghwa Heburoni ghuwa ghwa watsukulu wa Kalebu, mwana wa Yefune, imunu wa Kenizi mbaka leloli aino, kwaapfila yeye tsakamtegheletsa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli kwa ghumoyo ghwake ghwose. <verse eid="JOS 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 14:15" />Ghumwande ghumji ghwa Heburoni ghung'ali ghukemighwa Kiriati Ariba. Ariba tsakamanyika sideke kwa iwanu wa Anaki. Na isi yose tsaikala bila ukwitowa.<verse eid="JOS 14:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOS 15" />
  <para style="s">Isi yaweng'ighwe iwanu wa likabila lya Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 15:1" />Isi yaweng'ighwe iwanu wa likabila lya Yuda kwa kutowa simbi kwa kulola tsikolo tsawo pfatsili, yenela kulawa ubali wa kusini mashariki mbaka kuna ghumbaka ghwa Edomu. Na ghutsighila mna inyika ya Sini ubali wa kusini. <verse eid="JOS 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 15:2" />Ubali wa kusini ghumbaka ghwawo ghwanzila kwaitsighile ibahari ya Munyu. <verse eid="JOS 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 15:3" />Ghughendelela ubali wa kusini ghupfika mbaka Akirabimu, ghubita mmbalimbali mwa Sini, na kusini mwa Kadeshi Barinea, kuya ghwang'ila Hesironi, mbaka Adari, na ghutsunguluka Karika. <verse eid="JOS 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 15:4" />Kuya ghubita habehi na Asimoni, na ghuwinza ghumto ghwa Misiri na ghutsighila kuna ibahari ya Mediteraniya. Aghwo ghugho ghumbaka ghwenu ghwa ubali wa kusini. <verse eid="JOS 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 15:5" />Ghumbaka ghwa ubali wa mashaliki tsa ghukala ibahari ya Munyu mbaka ahala ghumto Yoridani haghukwingila mna ibahari. Na ghumbaka ghwa ubali wa kasikazini tsaghubita kulawa hana imembe ya bahari ya Munyu ahala haghukwingila ghumto Yoridani mna ibahari. <verse eid="JOS 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 15:6" />Kuya ghumbaka aghwo ghughendelela Beti Hogila, na ghwang'ila kasikazini mwa Beti Araba mbaka kuna libwe lya Bohani imwana wa Rubeni. <verse eid="JOS 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 15:7" />Pfipfila ghumbaka ghughendelela mbaka kuna ghumji ghwa Debili, ghutsunguluka mbaka kuna ilwanda lwa Akori, na kasikazini na ghughenda Giligali ghwilolesa na ghumwinuko ghwa Adumimu ighuli kusini mwa ghumto, kuya ghughenda mbaka kuna tsimbwibwi tsa Eni Shemeshi na ghutsighila Eni Rogeli. <verse eid="JOS 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 15:8" />Kuya ghumbaka aghwo ghupfika mna ilwanda lwa Hinomu, ubali wa kusini wa chidunda cha Wayebusi, ighukemighwe ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu, ghughendelela mbaka hana ihanu ha ukutambikila cha chidunda ichili maghalibi mwa lwanda lwa Hinomu na ghupfika kwalutsighila lwanda lwa Refaimu. <verse eid="JOS 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 15:9" />Kulawa aho hachidanando, ghutsunguluka kuna tsimbwibwi tsa ghamatsi tsa Nefutoa, kuya ghulawila hana imiji ya chidunda cha Efuroni, kuya ghuhundukila Baala, imanyika ka Kiriati Tearimu. <verse eid="JOS 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 15:10" />Kuya ghutsunguluka ghughenda Baala mbaka kuna chidunda Seili, ghubitila kasikazini mwa chidunda Yearimu, ighumanyika ka Kesaloni, na ghuhulumkila Beti Shemesi na ghubita habehi na Timna. <verse eid="JOS 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 15:11" />Kuya ghumbaka aghwo ghughendelela ubali wa kasikasini wa Ekironi, na ghutsunguluka kughenda Shikironi, na ghubita habehi na chindunda cha Baala mbaka Yabineeli na ghutsighila mna ibahari ya Mediteraniya. <verse eid="JOS 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 15:12" />Ghumbaka ghwa ubali wa maghalibi ghukala mna ibahari ya Mediteraniya. Apfi pfifo pfawabakane iwanu wa likabila lya Yuda ka kolo tsawo pfatsili.<verse eid="JOS 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu wa Kalebu woisola isi ya Heburoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 15:13" />Kuya Yoshua kamwing'a Kalebu imwana wa Yefune ingwe mna isi ya Yuda, ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse. Keng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Kiriati Ariba, iyakalile sekulu wake Anaki. Ghumji aghwo sambi ghokemighwa Heburoni. <verse eid="JOS 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 15:14" />Kalebu katsiwinga kolo ndatu tsa Waanaki, natso tsitso atsino: lukolo lwa Sheshai, lukoko lwa Ahimani, na lukolo lwa Talimai, iwali wana wa Anaki. <verse eid="JOS 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 15:15" />Kulawa Heburoni kawaghendela kuwatowa iwanu iwokala Debiri, ghumwande tsaghukemighwa Kiriati Seferi. <verse eid="JOS 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 15:16" />Kalebu kalonga, “Munu wowose iyatsoghutowa na kusola ghumji ghwa Seferi, nene nitsomwing'a Akisa, imwanangu pinga yamkwele, yawe mwehe wake.” <verse eid="JOS 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 15:17" />Otinieli, imwana wa Kenazi, ndughu yake Kalebu, kaghusola ghumji aghwo, apfo Kalebu kamwing'a imwanaghe yawe mwehe wake. <verse eid="JOS 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 15:18" />Mna litsuwa lyawo lya ukwikwela, Akisa kamlongela Otinieli yamlombe Kalebu mghunda. Akisa tsakadina chihongwe, na hayang'ali yohulumka, Kalebu kamghutsa, “Ubama nikwing'e choni?” <verse eid="JOS 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 15:19" />Akisa kamlongela, “Unighweke, ungaye isi ina tsimbwibwi tsa ghamatsi kwaapfila ako Negebu kwaungayile kuduhu matsi.” Apfo kalebu kamwing'a isi ya kuchanya ina tsimbwibwi na pfipfila kamwing'a isi ya kuisi ina tsimbwibwi. <verse eid="JOS 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 15:20" />Aino iyo isi yaweng'ighwe iwanu wa likabila lya Yuda, ka tsikolo tsawo pfatsili. <verse eid="JOS 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 15:21" />Imiji ikalile ubali wa kusini ghendo wa isi ya Wayuda kughenda kuna ghumbaka ghwa Edomu mna isi ya Negebu, iyo aino: ghumji ghwa Kabiseeli, ghwa Ederi, ghwa Yaguri, <verse eid="JOS 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 15:22" />ghwa Kina, ghwa Dimona, ghwa Adada, <verse eid="JOS 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 15:23" />ghwa Kedeshi, ghwa Hazori, ghwa Itinani, <verse eid="JOS 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 15:24" />ghwa Zifu, ghwa Telemu, ghwa Bealoti, <verse eid="JOS 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 15:25" />ghwa Hazori Hadata, ghwa Kerioti Hezironi, pfipfila ighumanyika Hazori, <verse eid="JOS 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 15:26" />ghwa Amamu, ghwa Shema, ghwa Molada <verse eid="JOS 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 15:27" />ghwa Hasali Gada, ghwa Heshimoni, ghwa Beti Peleti, <verse eid="JOS 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 15:28" />ghwa Hasali Shuali, ghwa Beeri Sheba, ghwa Biziotia, <verse eid="JOS 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 15:29" />ghwa Baala, ghwa Iyimu, ghwa Esemu, <verse eid="JOS 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 15:30" />ghwa Elitoladi, ghwa Kesili, ghwa Horima, <verse eid="JOS 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 15:31" />ghwa Sikilagi, ghwa Madimana, ghwa Sanisana, <verse eid="JOS 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 15:32" />ghwa Lebaoti, ghwa Shilihimu, ghwa Aini, ghwa Rimoni. Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsaipfika ishirini na tisa hamwe na pfijiji pfake. <verse eid="JOS 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 15:33" />Imiji ili mchiwala iyo aino: Eshitaoli, Sola, Ashina, <verse eid="JOS 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 15:34" />Zanoa, Enganimu, Tapua, Enamu, <verse eid="JOS 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 15:35" />Yamuti, Adulamu, Soko, Azeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 15:36" />Shaarimu, Aditaimu, Gedera, Gederotaimu. Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsaipfika kumi na mine hamwe na pfijiji pfake. <verse eid="JOS 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 15:37" />Pfipfila weng'ighwa imiji ya Senani, Hadasha, Migidali Gadi, <verse eid="JOS 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 15:38" />Dileani, Mizipa, Yokiteeli, <verse eid="JOS 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 15:39" />Lakishi, Bosikati, Egiloni, <verse eid="JOS 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 15:40" />Kaboni, Lahimamu, Kitilishi, <verse eid="JOS 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 15:41" />Gederoti, Beti Dagoni, Naama na Makeda. Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsaipfika kumi na sita hamwe na pfijiji pfake. <verse eid="JOS 15:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 15:42" />Kuya weng'ighwa imiji ya Libina, Eteri, Ashani, <verse eid="JOS 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 15:43" />Ifita, Ashina, Nesibu, <verse eid="JOS 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 15:44" />Keila, Akizibu, Maresha, imiji yose yaweng'iwe tsa tisa, hamwe na pfijiji pfake. <verse eid="JOS 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 15:45" />Pfipfila weng'ighwa Ekironi hamwe na imiji yake midodo na pfijiji pfake, <verse eid="JOS 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 15:46" />imiji yose na pfijiji pfose ipfikalile habehi na Ashidodi haghati ha Ekironi na ibahari ya Mediteraniya. <verse eid="JOS 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 15:47" />Pfipfila weng'ighwa Ashidodi na Gaza hamwe na imiji yawo na pfijiji pfawo pfose, mbaka hana ichikolongo cha Misiri mbaka kumwani kwa ibahari ya Mediteraniya. <verse eid="JOS 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 15:48" />Na imiji ikalile mna isi ya ipfidunda iyo aino: ghumji ghwa Shamiri, ghwa Yatiri, ghwa Soko, <verse eid="JOS 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 15:49" />ghwa Dana, ghwa Kiriati Sana ighumanyika ka Debiri, <verse eid="JOS 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 15:50" />ghwa Anabu, ghwa Eshitemoa, ghwa Animu, <verse eid="JOS 15:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 15:51" />ghwa Gosheni, ghwa Holoni, ghwa Gilo. Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsaipfika kumi na ghumwe hamwe na pfijiji pfake. <verse eid="JOS 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JOS 15:52" />Pfipfila tsaweng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Arabu, ghumji ghwa Duma, ghumji ghwa Eshani, <verse eid="JOS 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JOS 15:53" />ghumji ghwa Yanimu, ghwa Beti Tapua, ghwa Afeka, <verse eid="JOS 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JOS 15:54" />ghwa Humta, ghwa Kiriati Ariba, ighumanyika ka Heburoni, ghwa Siori. Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsaipfika tisa, hamwe na pfijiji pfake. <verse eid="JOS 15:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JOS 15:55" />Iwanu wa likabila lya Yuda pfipfila tsaweng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Maoni, ghwa Karimeli, ghwa Zifu, ghwa Yuta, <verse eid="JOS 15:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JOS 15:56" />ghwa Yezireeli, ghwa Yokideamu, ghwa Zanoa, <verse eid="JOS 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JOS 15:57" />ghwa Kaini, ghwa Gibea, ghwa Timna. Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsaipfika kumi, hamwe na pfijiji pfake. <verse eid="JOS 15:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JOS 15:58" />Pfipfila tsaweng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Halihuli, ghwa Betisuri, ghwa Gedori, <verse eid="JOS 15:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JOS 15:59" />ghwa Maarati, ghwa Beti Anoti, Elitekoni. Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsa sita, hamwe na pfijiji pfake. <verse eid="JOS 15:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="JOS 15:60" />Pfipfila tsaweng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Kiriati Baali, pfipfila ghwokemighwa Kiriati Yearimu, na ghwa Raba. Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsa mili hamwe na pfijiji pfake. <verse eid="JOS 15:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JOS 15:61" />Na imiji ya kunyika yaweng'ighwe iyo aino: ghumji ghwa Beti Araba, ghwa Midini, ghwa Sekaka, <verse eid="JOS 15:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JOS 15:62" />ghwa Nibishani, ghumji ghwa Munyu na Engedi. Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsa sita, hamwe na pfijiji pfake. <verse eid="JOS 15:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JOS 15:63" />Lekeni iwanu wa likabila lya Yuda ng'awadahile baye kuwawinga Wayebusi iwakalile Yerusalemu, na mbaka leloli Wayebusi wang'ali wokala hamwe na Wayuda ako Yerusalemu.<verse eid="JOS 15:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOS 16" />
  <para style="s">Isi ya Efulemu na ya Manase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 16:1" />Isi yawagholelighwe iwana wa Yosefu kwa kutowa simbi yanzila habehi na ghumto ghwa Yoridani, ubali wa mashariki wa imbwibwi ya Yeriko, ibitila mchiwala mbaka isi ya ipfidunda kupfika Beteli. <verse eid="JOS 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 16:2" />Kulawa Beteli ghumbaka ghughendelela mbaka Luzu, ghwang'ila mbaka Ataroti Adari kwawakalile Waariki. <verse eid="JOS 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 16:3" />Kuya ghuhulumkila maghalibi mna isi ya Wayafileti mbaka Beti Horoni ya hasi na Gezeri na ghutsighila mna ibahari ya Mediteraniya. <verse eid="JOS 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 16:4" />Apfo iwana wa Yosefu, iwali wa kabila lya Manase na Efulemu, weng'ighwa isi ayo iwe yawo.<verse eid="JOS 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi ya likabila lya Efulemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 16:5" />Isi ya iwana wa Efulemu kwa kulola tsikolo tsawo ka pfatsili tsaibakana apfino: ghumbaka ghwao ghwanzila ubali wa mashaliki ghubitila Ataroti Adari mbaka Beti Horoni ya kuchanya, <verse eid="JOS 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 16:6" />na ghutsighila kuna ibahari ya Mediteraniya. Kwa ubali wa kasikazini ghumbaka ghubita Mikimetati, na ubali wa mashariki ghutsunguluka mbaka Taanati Shilo kuya ghughenda mbaka ubali wa mashariki wa Yanoa. <verse eid="JOS 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 16:7" />Kuya ghuhulumkila Yanoa mbaka ghupfika kuna ghumji ghwa Ataroti na Naara na kupfika Yeriko, na ghutsighila kuna ghumto ghwa Yoridani. <verse eid="JOS 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 16:8" />Kulawa Tapua ghumbaka ghughenda magharibi mbaka chikolongo cha Kana na ghutsighila kuna Ibahari ya Mediteraniya. Aino iyo isi yaweng'ighwe kabila lya Waefuraimu kwa kulola tsikolo tsawo ka pfatsili, <verse eid="JOS 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 16:9" />hamwe na imiji yose na ipfijiji pfawongetsighwe kulawa kuna isi ya likabila lya Manase. <verse eid="JOS 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 16:10" />Iwanu wa likabila lya Efulemu ng'awawawingile baye Wakanani iwakalile Gezeri, nawo waghendelela kukala na iwanu wa kabila lya Efulemu mbaka leloli aino, na wawananahitsa kuwasang'anila.<verse eid="JOS 16:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOS 17" />
  <para style="s">Inusu ingi ya Wamanase yogholelighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 17:1" />Iwanu wa likabila lya Manase iyakalile mwana chaudele wa Yosefu, pfipfila tsaweng'ighwa isi yawo kwa kutowa simbi, isimbi imghwila Makiri mwana chaudele wa Manase. Ayo Makiri aba wake Gileadi, iyamanyile kwitowa pfinoghile, ma tsakeng'ighwa imiji ya Gileadi na Bashani kwa kutowa simbi, kwaapfila tsakadaha ukwitowa pfinoghile kung'ondo. <verse eid="JOS 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 17:2" />Iwanu wangi wa kabila lya Manase tsaweng'ighwa isi yawo kwa kutowa simbi kwa kulola tsikolo tsawo pfatsili. Tsikolo atso tsitso atsino: kolo tsa Abiezeri, Heleki, Asirieli, Shekemu, Heferi na Shemida. Awano iwo iwatsukulu wamale wa Manase, imwana wa Yosefu. <verse eid="JOS 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 17:3" />Lekeni Selofehadi mwana Heferi, mwana wa Gileadi, mwana wa Makiri, mwana wa Manase, yeye tsakahela wana wamale, ila tsakana wana wapinga waliyeka. Iwana awo wawo awano: Mahila, Noa, Hogila, Milika na Tiriza. <verse eid="JOS 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 17:4" />Iwana awo wapinga tsawamghendela imtambika Eleazeari na Yoshua, mwana wa Nuni na pfilongotsi wamwenga, walonga, “IMNDEWA tsakamlaghitsa Musa utugholele isi ka pfauwagholele iwamale wa likabila lyetu.” Apfo Yoshua kaweng'a isi yawo ka pfayaweng'ile iwamale wa likabila lyawo ka IMNDEWA pfayalaghitse. <verse eid="JOS 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 17:5" />Apfo likabila lya Manase libokela isi kumi, bila kupeta isi atsino mbili itsongetsighwe, isi ya Gileadi na ya Bashani itsili mashariki mwa ghumto Yoridani, <verse eid="JOS 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 17:6" />kwaapfila iwana wapinga wa Manase tsaweng'ighwa isi tsawo ka pfaweng'ighwe iwamale wa likabila lyawo. Na isi ya Gileadi tsaweng'ighwa watsukulu wangi wamale wa Manase. <verse eid="JOS 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 17:7" />Isi ya likabila lya Manase tsayanzila Asheri, na ighenda mbaka Mikimetati ubali wa mashariki wa ghumji ghwa Shekemu, na ghumbaka ghwawo ghughendelelela mbaka kusini kuna isi yawokala iwanu wa Eni Tapua. <verse eid="JOS 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 17:8" />Isi ya Tapua tsa yake Manase, lekeni ghumji aghula ghwa Tapua ighukalile mna ghumbaka ghwa Manase, tsaghuwa ghwa iwana wa Efulemu. <verse eid="JOS 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 17:9" />Ghumbaka aghwo ghughendelela mbaka kuna ichikolongo cha Kana. Na imiji ikalile kusini mwa chikolongo cha Kana, tsa iwa ya iwanu wa kabila lya Efulemu hata ka tsa yamna isi ya kabila lya Manase. Kuya ghumbaka ghwa Manase tsaghubita kasikazini ya ichikolongo cha Kana na ghutsighila kuna ibahari ya Mediteraniya. <verse eid="JOS 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 17:10" />Isi ya kusini tsa ya iwanu wa kabila lya Efulemu na isi ya kasikazini tsa ya wanu wa kabila lya Manase. Kwa ubali wa maghalibi tsawebakanila ibahari ya Mediteraniya na ghupfika Asheri ubali wa Kasikazini, na ghumbaka ghwa ubali wa mashariki ghupfika kuna isi ya likabila lya Isakari. <verse eid="JOS 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 17:11" />Pfipfila mna isi iweng'ighwe likabila lya Isakari na likabila lya Asheri, kabila lya Manase ling'ighwa miji ya Batisheani, miji ya Ibileamu hamwe na pfijiji pfake, miji ya Dori, miji ya Endori, miji ya Taanaki miji ya Megido hamwe na pfijiji pfake, na selusi imwe ya ghumji ghwa Nafati. <verse eid="JOS 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 17:12" />Lekeni iwanu wa Manase ng'awadahile baye kuwawinga iwanu wa imiji ayo, apfo Wakanaani waghendelela kukala amwo. <verse eid="JOS 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 17:13" />Waisiraeli hawawile na ngupfu, ng'awawawingile baye Wakanani, lekeni wawananahitsa wawasang'ane ng'onde tsawo.<verse eid="JOS 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Likabila lya Efulemu na lya Manase wolomba isi ingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 17:14" />Wanu wa Likabila lya Yosefu wamlongela Yoshua, “Ule kutugholela isi imwe iliyeka iwe yetu? Twetwe tubalikighwa na IMNDEWA na katutenda twawengi ng'ani.” <verse eid="JOS 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 17:15" />Yoshua kawedika, “Ka mwemwe mwawengi ng'ani na isi ya ipfidunda ya Efulemu ndodo kwa mwemwe ukukala amwo, mgheluke mghende kumuhulo kuna isi ya Waperizi na ya Warefai, mkaghane imibiki na kuko kuwe ukaye yenu.” <verse eid="JOS 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 17:16" />Iwanu wa likabila lya Yosefu wamwidika, “Isi ya ipfidunda ndodo ukukala twetwe, na Wakanaani wose iwokala kuchiwala wana mituka ya chuma, pfipfila na awala wose iwokala Beti Shani na pfijiji pfake pfose, wose iwokala mna ulwanda lwa Yazireeli nawo wana mituka ya chuma.” <verse eid="JOS 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 17:17" />Yoshua kawalongela iwatsukulu wa Yosefu, awala wa likabila lya Efulemu na lya Manase, “Ona, mwemwe mwawengi ghendo na mna ngupfu nyingi, ng'apfinoghile baye mpate isi imwe iliyeka. <verse eid="JOS 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 17:18" />Pfipfila isi ya ipfidunda itsakuwa yenu, hata ka sambi ya muhulo, lelo mghane imibiki ili mumo, na isi ayo yose itsakuwa yenu, namwe mtsowawinga Wakanaani hata ka wana mituka ya chuma na wana ngupfu.”<verse eid="JOS 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOS 18" />
  <para style="s">Isi isighale nayo yogholighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 18:1" />Waisraeli hawaisolile isi yose iwe yawo, wose tsawetingana ako Shilo, walimisa Lihema lya ukwitinganila. <verse eid="JOS 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 18:2" />Lekeni tsahana makabila saba ng'ana ghabokele baye isi tsawo. <verse eid="JOS 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 18:3" />Apfo Yoshua kawalongela Waisiraeli, “Angu mtsobeta mbaka tsuwachi kughenda kuisola isi aila IMNDEWA Imulungu, Imulungu wa aba tsenu iyaweng'ileni? <verse eid="JOS 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 18:4" />Muwasaghule wanu wadatu kulawa chila kabila, niwatume wakaipelembe isi ayo ka ina ukulu wachi, na wanyandikile pfaisogholighwa kwa ghamakabila ghawo, kuya watse wanongele pfaili. <verse eid="JOS 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 18:5" />Nawo watsoighola isi ayo iwe ingwe saba. Wanu wa Yuda watsokala ubali wawo wa kusini na wanu wa Yosefu watsokala ubali wawo wa kasikazini. <verse eid="JOS 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 18:6" />Namwe hamtsomalitsa ukwandika tsiingwe atso saba tsa isi ayo pfatsili, mndetele acho chamwandike. Na nene nitsakwasa isimbi iwalamlile hambele ha IMNDEWA Imulungu wetu. <verse eid="JOS 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 18:7" />Lekeni Walawi ng'awotsopata baye ingwe yoyose aila, kwaapfila wawo weng'ighwa ing'onde ya kumtambikila IMNDEWA Imulungu. Ghamakabila gha Gadi, na Rubeni na inusu ya iwanu wa kabila lya Manase wawo ma wabokela isi yawo ikalile ubali wa Mashariki ya ghumto Yoridani. Tsaweng'ighwa isi ayo na Musa imtumwa wa IMNDEWA Imulungu.”<verse eid="JOS 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 18:8" />Apfo iwanu awo wanza ghumwanza waghenda kuipelemba isi ayo. Kuya Yoshua kawalaghitsa apfi kalonga, “Mghende mkaipelembe isi yose ili pfihi na muyandike, kuya mmbuyile nene, na nene nitsakwasa simbi iwalamlile bahano Shilo hambele ha IMNDEWA Imulungu, chila kabila litsobokela ingwe yachi.” <verse eid="JOS 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 18:9" />Apfo iwanu awo waghenda, wanga isi yose, na wandika mbuli tsa ingwe atsila saba hamwe na imiji yake. Kuya woya kwa Yoshua akula Shilo kuna indalo. <verse eid="JOS 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 18:10" />Kuya Yoshua kawatowela simbi akula Shilo hambele ha IMNDEWA Imulungu, naye kawagholela Waisiraeli isi ayo, chila kabila libokela ingwe yake.<verse eid="JOS 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi ya kabila lya Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 18:11" />Isimbi ya mwanduso iwaghwila iwanu wa Banjamini kwa kulola tsikolo tsake pfatsili. Isi yaweng'ighwe tsaikala haghatighati ha kabila lya Yuda na Yosefu. <verse eid="JOS 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 18:12" />Ghumbaka ghwake ighuli ubali wa kasikazini tsaghwanzila ghumto ghwa Yoridani na ghwang'ila ubali wa kasikazini mwa Yeriko na isi ya pfidunda ghughenda maghalibi mbaka mna inyika ya Beti Aveni. <verse eid="JOS 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 18:13" />Kulawa ako, ghumbaka ghughenda kusini kune ghumji ghwa Luzu, sambi ghokemighwa ghumji ghwa Beteli, mbaka Ataroti Adari kuna ichidunda ichili kusini mwa Beti Horoni ya lwehisi. <verse eid="JOS 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 18:14" />Ghumbaka ighuli ubali wa maghalibi ghwanzila chidunda ichilola Beti Horoni mna ubali wa kusini, ghumbaka ghuhundukila magharibi mbaka ghupfika kuna ghumji ghwa Kiriati Baali, pfipfila ighukemighwa Kiriati Yearimu, ghumji ghwa iwanu wa kabila lya Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 18:15" />Ubali wa kusini ghumbaka ghwake ghwanzila kwaghutsighile ghumji ghwa Kiriati Yearimu, na ghupfika Efroni na kughenda mbaka kuna imbwibwi ya ghamatsi ya Nefutoa. <verse eid="JOS 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 18:16" />Kuya ghuhulumka lwehisi kubitila mbalimbali mwa chidunda ichilolesa na ulwanda lwa mwana wa Hinomu, uli kasikazini mwa ulwanda lwa Warefai. Pfipfila ghuhulumka mbaka kuna ulwanda lwa Hinomu, kusini mwa chidunda cha Wayebusi, ghughendelela kuhulumka mbaka ghupfika Eni Rogeli. <verse eid="JOS 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 18:17" />Kuya ghumbaka ghuhulumka mbaka kasikazini ghughenda mbaka En Shemeshi, ghwang'ila Geliloti ing'ali ilolesa na lughongo lwa Adumimu, kuya ghuhulumka kuna libwe lya Bohani mwana wa Rubeni. <verse eid="JOS 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 18:18" />Kulawa aho, ghumbaka ghutsunguluka kasikazini mmbalimbali mwa Araba na kutsighila kuko Araba.<verse eid="JOS 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 18:19" />Kuya ghughendelela ubali wa kasikazini wa chidunda cha Beti Hogila na kutsighila ya kasikazini hanu hasakale ha ibahari ya Munyu, haghukwingilila ghumto Yoridani. Aghuno ghugho ghumbaka ghwa ubali wa kusini. <verse eid="JOS 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 18:20" />Ubali wa mashariki ghumto Yoridani tsaghukala mbaka ghwake. Aino iyo imibaka ikighwe mna isi tsaweng'ighwe kolo tsa likabila lya Benjamini.<verse eid="JOS 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 18:21" />Imiji ya tsikolo tsa likabila lya Benjamini iyo aino: ghumji ghwa Yeriko, ghumji ghwa Beti Hogila, ghumji ghwa Emeki Kesisi, <verse eid="JOS 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 18:22" />ghumji ghwa Beti Araba, ghumji ghwa Zemaraimu, ghumji ghwa Beteli, <verse eid="JOS 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 18:23" />ghumji ghwa Avimu, ghumji ghwa Para, ghumji ghwa Ofira, <verse eid="JOS 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 18:24" />ghumji ghwa Kefari Amoni, ghumji ghwa Ofini, na ghumji ghwa Geba. Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsaipfika kumi na mili, hamwe na pfijiji pfake pfose. <verse eid="JOS 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 18:25" />Pfipfila likabila lya Benjamini tsaweng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Gibeoni, ghumji ghwa Rama, ghumji ghwa Beeroti, <verse eid="JOS 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 18:26" />ghumji ghwa Misipa, ghumji ghwa Kefira, ghumji ghwa Moza, <verse eid="JOS 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 18:27" />ghumji ghwa Rekemu, ghumji ghwa Iripeeli, ghumji ghwa Tarala, <verse eid="JOS 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 18:28" />ghumji ghwa Zela, ghumji ghwa Haelefu, na ghumji ghwa Yebusi pfipfila ighukemighwe Yerusalemu, na Gibea na ghumji ghwa Kiriati Yearimu. Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsaipfika kumi na mine hamwe na pfijiji pfake. Ayo iyo isi yaweng'ighwe iwanu wa kabila lya Benjamini kwa kulola tsikolo tsawo ka pfitsili.<verse eid="JOS 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOS 19" />
  <para style="s">Isi yaweng'ighwe kabila lya Simioni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 19:1" />Isimbi ya keli iwaghwila iwanu wa likabila lya Simioni kwa kulola tsikolo tsawo. Isi yawo yaweng'ighwe tsaitsungulukighwa na isi ya kabila lya Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 19:2" />Imiji yawo iyo aino: ghumji ghwa Beeri Sheba, ghumji ghwa Sheba, ghumji ghwa Molada, <verse eid="JOS 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 19:3" />ghumji ghwa Hasari Shuali, ghumji ghwa Bala, ghumji ghwa Esemu, <verse eid="JOS 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 19:4" />ghumji ghwa Elitoladi, ghumji ghwa Betuli, ghumji ghwa Horima, <verse eid="JOS 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 19:5" />ghumji ghwa Sikilagi, ghumji ghwa Beti Marikaboti, ghumji ghwa Hasari Susa, <verse eid="JOS 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 19:6" />ghumji ghwa Beti Lebaoti, na ghumji ghwa Sharuheni. Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsaipfika kumi na midatu, hamwe na pfijiji pfake. <verse eid="JOS 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 19:7" />Pfipfila tsahana ghumji ghwa Aini, ghumji ghwa Rimoni, ghumji ghwa Eteri, na ghumji ghwa Ashani. Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsa mine hamwe na pfijiji pfake. <verse eid="JOS 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 19:8" />Pfipfila tsaweng'ighwa pfijiji pfose ipfitsunguluke imiji ayo mbaka ghumji ghwa Baalati Beeri au ighukemighwe Rama ya kusini. Ayo yose iyo isi yaweng'ighwe iwanu wa likabila lya Simioni. <verse eid="JOS 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 19:9" />Kwaapfila isi yaweng'ighwe likabila lya Yuda tsang'ulu kubita aila yawabamile, apfo isi isighale wawagholela likabila lya Simioni. Isi ayo tsaikala haghatighati ha imibaka ya isi ya Yuda.<verse eid="JOS 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi yaweng'ighwe likabila lya Zabuloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 19:10" />Isimbi ya kadatu iwaghwila likabila lya Zabuloni kwa kulola tsikolo tsawo, isi yawo tsaipfika mbaka kuna ghumji ghwa Saridi. <verse eid="JOS 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 19:11" />Kulawa ako ghumbaka ghwake ghughenda maghalibi mbaka kuna ghumji ghwa Mareali, ghwang'ila mmbalilmbali mwa ghumji ghwa Debesheti, na ghughenda kuna ichikolongo cha ghamatsi ichilolesa na mashariki ya ghumji ghwa Yokineamu. <verse eid="JOS 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 19:12" />Kuya ghutsunguluka kulawa Saridi na ghughendelela ubali wa mashariki kwalilawila litsua mbaka ghupfika kuna ghumbaka ghwa Kisiloti Tabori, kuya ghulawilila kuna ghumji ghwa Daberati na ghugheluka mbaka kuna ghumji ghwa Yafia. <verse eid="JOS 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 19:13" />Kuya ghughendelela mashariki mbaka kuna ghumji ghwa Gati Heferi, na ghupfika kuna ghumji ghwa Eti Kasini kuya ghulawilila kuna ghumji ghwa Rimoni na kupfika kuna ghumji ghwa Nea. <verse eid="JOS 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 19:14" />Kuya ghumbaka aghwo ghutsunguluka isi ayo ubali wa kasikazini mbaka kuna ghumji ghwa Hanatoni, na ghutsighila mna ilwanda lwa Ifitaheli. <verse eid="JOS 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 19:15" />Ung'ongetsa ghumji aghuno ghwa Katati, ghumji ghwa Nahalali, ghumji ghwa Shimironi, ghumji ghwa Idala na ghumji ghwa Betilehemu, imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsaipfika kumi na mili hamwe na pfijiji pfake. <verse eid="JOS 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 19:16" />Ayo iyo imiji yaweng'ighwe iwanu wa likabila lya Zabuloni na pfijiji pfake kwa ukulola tsikolo tsawo.<verse eid="JOS 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi yaweng'ighwe kabila lya Isakari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 19:17" />Isimbi ya kane iwaghwila iwanu wa kabila lya Isakari kwa kulola tsikaye tsake. <verse eid="JOS 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 19:18" />Isi yawo tsaina miji aino: ghumji ghwa Yezireeli, ghumji ghwa Kesuloti, ghumji ghwa Shunemu, <verse eid="JOS 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 19:19" />ghumji ghwa Hafaraimu, ghumji ghwa Shioni, ghumji ghwa Anaharati, <verse eid="JOS 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 19:20" />ghumji ghwa Rabiti, ghumji ghwa Kishioni, ghumji ghwa Ebesi, <verse eid="JOS 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 19:21" />ghumji ghwa Remeti, ghumji ghwa Eni Ganimu, ghumji ghwa Eni Hada, na ghumji ghwa Beti Pasesi. <verse eid="JOS 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 19:22" />Na isi yawo ibakana na ghumji ghwa Tabori, ghwa Shahasuma, ghwa Beti Shemeshi, na ghumbaka ghwake ghutsighila kuna ghumto ghwa Yoridani. Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsaipfika kumi na sita hamwe na pfijiji pfake. <verse eid="JOS 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 19:23" />Ayo iyo imiji yaweng'ighwe iwanu wa kabila lya Isakari kwa kolo tsawo, hamwe na pfijiji pfake.<verse eid="JOS 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi yaweng'ighwe kabila lya Asheri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 19:24" />Isimbi ya tano iwaghwila kolo tsa kabila lya Asheri na tsikaye tsake. <verse eid="JOS 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 19:25" />Imiji ya isi iyo aino: ghumji ghwa Helikati, ghumji ghwa Hali, ghumji ghwa Beteni, ghumji ghwa Akishafi, <verse eid="JOS 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 19:26" />ghumji ghwa Alameleki, ghumji ghwa Amadi na ghumji ghwa Mishali. Ubali wa maghalibi isi ibakana na ichidunda Karimeli na Shihori Libinati. <verse eid="JOS 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 19:27" />Kuya ghutsunguluka mashariki ghughenda kuna ghumji ghwa Beti Dagoni, ako ghubakana na isi ya Zebuluni na ilwanda lwa Ifitaheli. Kuya ghughendelela kasikazini mbaka kuna ghumji ghwa Beti Emeki, ghwa Neieli na ghulawilila kuna ghumji ghwa Kabuli, <verse eid="JOS 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 19:28" />ghumji ghwa Eburoni, ghumji ghwa Rehobu, ghumji ghwa Hamoni, ghumji ghwa Kana mbaka kuna ghumji ghwa Sidoni ighuli mkulu. <verse eid="JOS 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 19:29" />Kuya ghumbaka aghwo ghutsunguluka ghughenda kuna ghumji ghwa Rama, ghupfika mbaka kuna ghumji ghwa Tiro, ghumji ighutsungulukighwe na ubanda, kuya ghwang'ila kuna ghumji ghwa Hosa na kutsighila kuna ibahari ya Mediteraniya. Na imiji imwenga ili mumo iyo aino: Ghumji ghwa Maharabu, ghumji ghwa Akizibu, <verse eid="JOS 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 19:30" />ghumji ghwa Uma, ghumji ghwa Afeka na ghumji ghwa Rehobu. Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe ipfika ishirini na mili hamwe na pfijiji pfake. <verse eid="JOS 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 19:31" />Aino iyo imiji yaweng'ighwe iwanu wa likabila lya Asheri kwa kulola tsikolo tsawo, hamwe na pfijiji pfake.<verse eid="JOS 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi yaweng'ighwe kabila lya Nafutali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 19:32" />Isimbi ya sita iwaghwila iwanu wa likabila lya Nafutali kwa kulola tsikaye tsake pfatsili. <verse eid="JOS 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 19:33" />Ghumbaka ghwake ghwanzila kuna ghumji ghwa Helefu na kuna mbiki mkulu ighukemighwe mwaloni ighuli mna ghumji ghwa Zaananimu, ghubitila kuna ghumji ghwa Adami Nekebu, ghwa Yabineeli mbaka kuna ghumji ghwa Lakumu na ghutsighila kuna ghumto Yoridani. <verse eid="JOS 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 19:34" />Kuya ghutsunguluka maghalibi ghubita mbaka kuna ghumji ghwa Azinoti Tabori na ghulawila kuna ghumji ghwa Hukoki, na ghutsigha hana isi ya likabila lya Zabuloni ubali wa kusini, kuya ghwibakana na isi ya likabila lya Asheri ubali wa maghalibi, na ghwibakana na Yuda ubali wa mashaliki hana ghumto Yoridani. <verse eid="JOS 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 19:35" />Na imiji itsungulusighwe ubanda iyo aino: ghumji ghwa Sidimu, ghumji ghwa Seri, ghumji ghwa Hamati, ghumji ghwa Rakati, ghumji ghwa Kinereti, <verse eid="JOS 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 19:36" />ghumji ghwa Adama, ghumji ghwa Rama, ghumji ghwa Hazori, <verse eid="JOS 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 19:37" />ghumji ghwa Kedeshi, ghumji ghwa Edirei, ghumji ghwa Eni Hasori, <verse eid="JOS 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 19:38" />ghumji ghwa Yironi, ghumji ghwa Migidaleli, ghumji ghwa Horemu, ghumji ghwa Beti Anati na ghumji Beti Shemeshi. Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsaipfika kumi na tisa na pfijiji pfake. <verse eid="JOS 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 19:39" />Aino iyo imiji yaweng'ighwe iwanu wa likabila lya Nafutali hamwe na pfijiji pfake.<verse eid="JOS 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi yaweng'ighwe kabila lya Dani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 19:40" />Isimbi ya saba iwaghwila iwanu wa kabila lya Dani. <verse eid="JOS 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 19:41" />Isi yawo tsaina miji aino: ghumji ghwa Sora, ghumji ghwa Eshitaoli, ghumji ghwa Irishemeshi, <verse eid="JOS 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 19:42" />ghumji ghwa Shaalabini, ghumji ghwa Aiyaloni, ghumji ghwa Itila, <verse eid="JOS 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 19:43" />ghumji ghwa Eloni, ghumji ghwa Timna, ghumji ghwa Ekironi, <verse eid="JOS 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 19:44" />ghumji ghwa Eliteke, ghumji ghwa Gibetoni, ghumji ghwa Baalati, <verse eid="JOS 19:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 19:45" />ghumji ghwa Yehudi, ghumji ghwa Bene Beraki, ghumji ghwa Gati Rimoni, <verse eid="JOS 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 19:46" />ghumji ghwa Me Yarikoni na Rakoni isi ili habei na ghumji ghwa Yopa. <verse eid="JOS 19:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 19:47" />Iwanu wa Likabila lya Dani ng'awadahile kusola isi iyaweng'ighwe. Apfo waghenda na kuwatowa iwanu iwakalile mna ghumji ghwa Leshemu. Wawatowa na wasola ghumji aghwo, na kukala mumo, waghukema ghumji aghwo Dani, taghwa lya mhenga wawo. <verse eid="JOS 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 19:48" />Aino iyo imiji yaweng'ighwe iwanu wa kabila lya Dani na pfijiji pfake, ka tsikaye tsawo pfatsili.<verse eid="JOS 19:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isi iyeng'ighwe Yoshua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 19:49" />Hawamalitse kwigholela isi yose, Waisiraeli wamwing'a Yoshua, imwana wa Nuni, ingwe yake haghatighati hawo. <verse eid="JOS 19:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 19:50" />Ka IMNDEWA Imulungu pfayalaghitse, Waisiraeli tsawamwing'a Yoshua ghumji ghwa Timunati Sela, ghumji ghwayaghusaghule yeye mwenyegho, ghumji ighukalile mna isi ya ipfidunda pfa Efulemu. Naye kaghutsenga keli na kakala mumo. <verse eid="JOS 19:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 19:51" />Atsino tsitso tsiisi imtambika Eliazari na Yoshua mwana Nuni, hamwe na pfilongotsi wa ghamakabila gha Waisiraeli tsawagholile kwa kutowa simbi hambele ha IMNDEWA Imulungu hana ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya kwitinganila ako kuna ghumji ghwa Shilo. Apfo pfipfo pfawamalitse isang'ano ya kuighola isi.<verse eid="JOS 19:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOS 20" />
  <para style="s">Imiji ya Ukutsumila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="NUM 35:9-34">Kupet 35:9-34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:1-13">Kumb 19:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 20:1" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Yoshua, <verse eid="JOS 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 20:2" />“Walongele Waisiraeli wabaghule imiji ya ukutsumila wanu, ka pfanimlaghitse Musa yakulongele, <verse eid="JOS 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 20:3" />ili munu yang'amkoma miyaghe aku ng'abamile kumkoma baye, yadahe kutsumila kuko, na kumhepa imunu ayula iyobama kumkoma imunu iyamkomile ndughu yake. <verse eid="JOS 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 20:4" />Naye katsotsumila mna ghumji ghumwe ghwa imiji ayo, na yeme hana lilango lya ghumji na yawalongele iwakulu wa ghumji aghwo achila chayatendile, nawo womwingitsa mghati na womwing'a hanu ha ukukala nawo. <verse eid="JOS 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 20:5" />Ka imunu ayula iyobama kumkoma imunu iyamkomile miyaghe komuwinza mbaka kuna ghumji, iwakulu wa ghumji waleke kumlapfa imunu iyakomile, kwaapfila kamkoma miyaghe aku ng'abamile kumkoma baye kwaapfila tsang'amwihile baye. <verse eid="JOS 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 20:6" />Imunu iyakomile miyaghe katsokala mna ghumji aghwo mbaka hayatsakwima yahighighwe hambele ha ghumtingano ghwa iwalamtsi wa Isiraeli na pfipfila katsokala mbaka imtambika mkulu wa ghamatsuwa agho yafe. Kuya yoye kuna isi yake iyalawile.”<verse eid="JOS 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 20:7" />Apfo wabaghula ghumji ghwa Kadeshi ighuli Galilaya kuna ichidunda cha Nafutali na ghumji ghwa Shekemu, ighuli mna ipfidunda pfa Efuraimu, na ghumji ghwa Kiriati Ariba, pfipfila ighumanyika ka Heburoni mna isi ya pfidunda ya Yuda. <verse eid="JOS 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 20:8" />Kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani, mashariki mwa ghumji ghwa Yeriko, wabaghula ghumji ghwa Bezeli ighuli mna inyika ya chiwala ya likabila lya Rubeni. Pfipfila wabaghula ghumji ghwa Ramoti ako Gileadi, nagho pfipfila tsa ghumji ghwa likabila lya Wagadi na wabaghula ghumji ghwa Golani ako Bashani mna isi ya likabila lya Manase. <verse eid="JOS 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 20:9" />Munu wowose wa Isiraeli au imgheni iyokala nawo, yang'amkoma munu aku ng'abamile kumkoma baye, kodaha kutsumila kuna imiji ayo ibaghulighwe, ili yaleke kukomighwa na imunu ayula iyobama kumkoma imunu ayula iyamkomile miyaghe.<verse eid="JOS 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOS 21" />
  <para style="s">Imiji ya Walawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 21:1" />Ako Shilo mna isi ya Kanaani, iwakulu wa kolo tsa Walawi waghenda kwa Eleazari, imtambika mkulu na kwa Yoshua, mwana wa Nuni na waghenda kwa iwakulu wa kolo tsa ghamakabila gha Isiraeli, <verse eid="JOS 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 21:2" />wawalongela, “IMNDEWA tsakalaghitsa kubitila Musa twing'ighwe isi ya ukukala, na mighunda ya ukudimila wanyama wetu.” <verse eid="JOS 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 21:3" />Apfo, Waisiraeli waweng'a Walawi imiji aino hamwe na imighunda ya ukudimila wanyama wawo, ka IMNDEWA pfayalaghitse. <verse eid="JOS 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 21:4" />Tsawasa tsisimbi tsilamle, na isimbi ya kwanza iwaghwila iwanu wa lukolo lwa Kohati. Walawi iwali watsukulu wa Aruni imtambika, wawo tsaweng'ighwa miji kumi na midatu kulawa mna isi yaweng'ighwe likabila lya Yuda na mna isi ya likabila lya Simioni na mna isi ya likabila lya Benjamini. <verse eid="JOS 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 21:5" />Lwakeli, isimbi iwaghwila Walawi wangi wa lukolo lwa Wakohati. Wawo tsaweng'ighwa miji kumi kulawa mna isi tsaweng'ighwe iwanu wa likabila lya Efuraimu, na lya Dani na nusu ya likabila lya Manase. <verse eid="JOS 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 21:6" />Lwakadatu, isimbi iwaghwila Walawi wa lukolo lwa Gerishoni, wawo tsaweng'ighwa miji kumi na midatu kulawa mna tsiisi tsaweng'ighwe likabila lya Isakari na Asheri na Nafutali na nusu ya isi ya likabila lya Manase ako Bashani. <verse eid="JOS 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 21:7" />Iwanu wa lukolo lwa Merali tsaweng'ighwa miji kumi na mili mna isi yaweng'ighwe kabila lya Rubeni, kabila lya Gadi na kabila lya Zabuloni. <verse eid="JOS 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 21:8" />Waisiraeli tsawaweng'a Walawi imiji aino hamwe na mighunda ya ukudimila iwanyama wawo ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse Musa.<verse eid="JOS 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 21:9" />Aghano ghagho mataghwa gha imiji ibaghulighwe kulawa mna isi yawokala kabila lya Yuda na Simioni. <verse eid="JOS 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 21:10" />Wanza kubaghula imiji iwe ya iwanu wa lukolo lwa Kohati iwawile watsukulu wa Aruni, kwaapfila isimbi yanza kuwaghwila wawo. <verse eid="JOS 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 21:11" />Weng'ighwa Kiriati Ariba ghumji ighumanyika ka Heburoni mna ipfidunda pfa isi ya Yuda hamwe na mighunda ya ukudimila itsinguluke isi yose. Ariba tsa aba wake Anaki. <verse eid="JOS 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 21:12" />Lekeni imighunda ya imiji ayo na ipfijiji ipfili habehi, tsakeng'ighwa Kalebu mwana wa Yefune pfiwe pfake. <verse eid="JOS 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 21:13" />Apfo watsukulu wa Aruni, imtambika, weng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Heburoni, ghuwe ghumji ghwa ukutsumila kwa munu wowose iyakomile. Pfipfila weng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Libina hamwe na mighunda yake ya ukudimila. <verse eid="JOS 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 21:14" />Kuya tsaweng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Yatiri hamwe na imighunda yake ya ukudimila, na ghumji ghwa Eshitemoa hamwe na imighuda yake. <verse eid="JOS 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 21:15" />Pfipfila tsaweng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Holoni hamwe na imighunda ya ukudimila na ghumji ghwa Debiri hamwe na imighunda yake ya ukudimila. <verse eid="JOS 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 21:16" />Pfipfila weng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Aini na ghumji ghwa Yuta na ghumji ghwa Beti Shemeshi, chila mji hamwe na imighunda yake ya ukudimila. Imiji yose tsaipfika tisa mna isi yaweng'ighwe ghamakabila agho meli.<verse eid="JOS 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 21:17" />Mna isi ya likabila lya Benjamini tsaweng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Gibeoni, ghumji ghwa Geba, <verse eid="JOS 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 21:18" />ghumji ghwa Anatoti na ghumji ghwa Alimoni, imiji ayo yose tsa ina imighunda ya ukudimila, imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsa mine. <verse eid="JOS 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 21:19" />Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe watsukulu wa Aruni, iwatambika, tsa kumi na midatu hamwe na mighunda yawo ya ukudimila. <verse eid="JOS 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 21:20" />Kolo tsikalile tsa Wakohati, nawo pfipfila tsa Walawi, tsaweng'ighwa imiji yawo mna isi ya likabila lya Efuraimu. <verse eid="JOS 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 21:21" />Tsaweng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Shekemu, nagho ghuwe ghumji ghwa ukutsumila imunu iyakomile, hamwe na imighunda ya ukudimila mna isi ya ipfidunda ya Efuraimu, na ghumji ghwa Gezeri hamwe na imighunda yake ya ukudimila, <verse eid="JOS 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 21:22" />na weng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Kibizaimu na ghumji ghwa Beti Holoni, hamwe na mighunda yawo ya ukudimila, imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsa mine. <verse eid="JOS 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 21:23" />Pfipfila kulawa mna isi ya likabila lya Dani tsaweng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Eliteke na ghumji ghwa Gibetoni, hamwe na imighunda yawo ya ukudimila, <verse eid="JOS 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 21:24" />ghumji ghwa Aiyaloni na ghumji ghwa Gati Rimoni, hamwe na mighunda yawo ya ukudimila, miji yose yaweng'ighwe tsa mine. <verse eid="JOS 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 21:25" />Inusu ya likabila lya Manase tsaweng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Taanaki na ghumji ghwa Gati Rimoni hamwe na imighunda yawo ya ukudimila. Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsa mili. <verse eid="JOS 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 21:26" />Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsikolo tsikalile tsa Wakohati tsaipfika kumi hamwe na imighunda yawo ya ukudimila.<verse eid="JOS 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 21:27" />Walawi wamwenga, wa ilukolo lwa Gerishoni wawo tsaweng'ighwa miji mili kulawa mna inusu ya likabila lya Manase. Ghumji ghumwe tsa Golani ighuli Bashani, ghumji ghwa ukutsumila imunu iyakomile, na ghumji ghungi tsa Beeshi Tera hamwe na mighunda yawo ya ukudimila. <verse eid="JOS 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 21:28" />Kulawa mna isi ya likabila lya Isakari, weng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Kishioni na ghumji ghwa Daberati hamwe na imighunda yawo ya ukudimila, <verse eid="JOS 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 21:29" />kuya weng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Yarimuti na Eni Ganimu hamwe na mighunda yawo ya ukudimila. Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsa mine. <verse eid="JOS 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 21:30" />Kulawa mna isi ya kabila lya Asheri, tsaweng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Mishali na ghumji ghwa Abidoni hamwe na mighunda yawo ya ukudimila, <verse eid="JOS 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 21:31" />kuya weng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Helikati hamwe na imighunda yake ya ukudimila, na ghumji ghwa Rehobu hamwe na imighunda yake ya ukudimila. Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsa mine. <verse eid="JOS 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 21:32" />Kulawa mna isi ya likabila lya Nafutali tsaweng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Kadeshi ighuli Galilaya, ghumji ghumwe ghwa ukutsumila, hamwe na imighunda yake ya ukudimila, na ghumji ghwa Hamoti Dori hamwe na imighunda yake ya ukudimila, na ghumji ghwa Karitani hamwe na imighunda yake ya ukudimila. Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsa midatu. <verse eid="JOS 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 21:33" />Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsikolo tsa Wagerishoni tsaipfika kumi na midatu hamwe na imighunda yake ya ukudimila. <verse eid="JOS 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 21:34" />Walawi wamwenga iwasighale, awala wa ilukolo lwa Merari, tsaweng'ighwa miji mna isi ya Zabuloni. Ghumji ghwa Yokineamu hamwe na mighunda yake ya ukudimila, ghumji ghwa Karita hamwe na mighunda yake ya ukudimila, <verse eid="JOS 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 21:35" />kuya tsaweng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Dimna hamwe na mighunda yake ya ukudimila, na ghumji ghwa Nahalali hamwe na mighunda yake ya ukudimila. Imiji yose tsa mine. <verse eid="JOS 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 21:36" />Kulawa mna isi ya likabila lya Rubeni tsaweng'ighwa, ghumji ghwa Bezeri hamwe na mighunda yake ya ukudimila, na ghumji ghwa Yahazi hamwe na mighunda yake ya ukudimila, <verse eid="JOS 21:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 21:37" />pfipfila tsaweng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Kedemoti hamwe na mighunda yake ya ukudimila na ghumji ghwa Mefaati hamwe na imighunda yake ya ukudimila. <verse eid="JOS 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 21:38" />Kulawa mna isi ya likabila lya Gadi tsaweng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Ramoti ighuli Gileadi, ghumji ghwa ukutsumila hamwe na imighunda yake ya ukudimila, na ghumji ghwa Mahanaimu hamwe na mighunda yake ya ukudimila, <verse eid="JOS 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 21:39" />kuya weng'ighwa ghumji ghwa Heshiboni hamwe na imighunda yake ya ukudimila na ghumji ghwa Yazeri hamwe na imighunda yake ya ukudimila. Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsa mine. <verse eid="JOS 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 21:40" />Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe tsikolo tsa Wamerari, tsikolo itsisighale tsa Walawi, tsa kumi na mili hamwe na imighunda yake ya ukudimila. <verse eid="JOS 21:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 21:41" />Imiji yose yaweng'ighwe Walawi kulawa mna isi ya Waisiraeli tsa alubaini na nane hamwe na imighunda yawo ya ukudimila. <verse eid="JOS 21:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 21:42" />Imighunda ya ukudimila wanyama tsaitsunguluka mna chila mji ghwa imiji ayo.<verse eid="JOS 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 21:43" />Apfo IMNDEWA tsakaweng'a Waisiraeli isi yose iyelahile kwa iwahenga wawo ka katsoweng'a. Nawo waisola iwa yawo na wakala mumo. <verse eid="JOS 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 21:44" />Kuya IMNDEWA kawatenda wakale tseghamba mna chila ubali wa isi ayo, ka apfila pfayelahile kwa iwahenga wawo, kwaapfila IMNDEWA tsakawapfila Waisiraeli wawatowe awala wose iwowehila. <verse eid="JOS 21:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 21:45" />Kuduhu chinu chochose chinoghile IMNDEWA chayelaghane na Waisiraeli ing'achilawile baye. Chila chinu chayelaghane nawo tsachilawila.<verse eid="JOS 21:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOS 22" />
  <para style="s">Ghamakabila ghakuya mna isi tsawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 22:1" />Apfo Yoshua kawekama hamwe iwanu wa likabila lya Rubeni, na lya Gadi na nusu ya likabila lya Manase, <verse eid="JOS 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 22:2" />kawalongela, “Mwemwe mghawinza aghala ghose Musa imtumighwa wa IMNDEWA, ghayawalaghitse na mghakinda ghose ghaniwalaghitse. <verse eid="JOS 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 22:3" />Wala ng'amuwalekile waliyeka baye ndughu tsenu kwa matsuwa agho ghose mbaka leloli aino, lekeni mghawinza ghamalaghitso ghayawalongele IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="JOS 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 22:4" />Sambi IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu kawatenda ndughu tsenu wabwihile, ka pfayawalongele, lelo muye mkaye mwenu mna isi iyaweng'ile Musa imtumwa wa Imulungu, ili kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani. <verse eid="JOS 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 22:5" />Mwalangitse kughakinda malaghitso ghayawalongele Musa imtumwa wa IMNDEWA, mumkunde IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu, mtende ghayobama yeye, mkinde malaghitso ghake na mwikinde naye, na mumsang'anile yeye kwa ghumoyo ghwenu ghwose na kwa ghumuhe ghwenu ghwose.” <verse eid="JOS 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 22:6" />Kuya Yoshua kawabaliki na kawaleka woke mmakaye mwawo. <verse eid="JOS 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 22:7" />Musa tsakaweng'a nusu ya likabila lya Manase isi yawo ako Bashani. Naye Yoshua tsakaweng'a inusu ingi ya likabila lilyo iwe isi yawo ubali wa maghalibi wa ghumto Yoridani. Kuya Yoshua kawabaliki na kawaleka woke. <verse eid="JOS 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 22:8" />Kawalongela, “Mwemwe mwakuya mna tsikaye tsenu aku mna mali nyingi, mna ng'ombe wengi na fetsa, nzahabu, shaba, chuma na maghwanda mengi ghanoghile. Apfo muwagholele wayenu aghala ghambokile kulawa kwa awala iwowehila.”<verse eid="JOS 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matsabahu habehi na ghumto Yoridani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 22:9" />Apfo iwanu wa kabila lya Rubeni, na Wagadi na inusu ya iwanu wa Manase wawaleka Waisiraeli wayawo ako Shilo mna isi ya Kanaani, na woya ukaye yawo mna isi ya Gileadi, isi iweng'ighwe iwe yawo ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse Musa. <verse eid="JOS 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 22:10" />Hawapfikile mna ghumji ghwa Geliloti ighuli habehi na ghumto Yoridani mna isi ya Kanaani, iwanu wa kabila lya Rubeni na Gadi na inusu ya kabila lya Manase watsenga matsabahu ng'ulu habehi na ghumto aghwo. <verse eid="JOS 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 22:11" />Apfo Waisiraeli wamwenga tsawahulika ka ghamakabila gha Rubeni na Gadi na inusu ya likabila lya Manase watsenga matsabahu ng'ulu habehi na ghumto Yoridani mna isi ya Kanaani, isi ya wana wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="JOS 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 22:12" />Waisiraeli hawahulike apfo, wose wetingana hamwe ako Shilo, waghende weketowe na ghamakabila aghwo. <verse eid="JOS 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 22:13" />Apfo iwanu wa Isiraeli wamtuma Finehasi, imwanaghe Eliazari, iyakalile mtambika mkulu yaghende Gileadi kwa kabila lya Rubeni, na lya Gadi, na inusu ya likabila lya Manase. <verse eid="JOS 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 22:14" />Pfipfila wawatuma wakulu kumi welongotse naye, chila mkulu kulawa mna chila likabila lya Isiraeli, na chila yumwe yang'ali yolongotsa lukolo mna iwanu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="JOS 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 22:15" />Nawo wawaghendela iwanu wa kabila lya Rubeni, Gadi na nusu ya likabila lya Manase ako Gileadi, wawalongela apfino, <verse eid="JOS 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 22:16" />“Iwanu wose wa IMNDEWA woghutsa apfino, ‘Ule mumtendela Imulungu wa Isiraeli chinu achino chihile? Ule mleka kumuwinza IMNDEWA kwa kutsenga matsabahu aino? <verse eid="JOS 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 22:17" />Apfi aghala ghehile ghatutendile akula Peori si chidogho baye? Mbaka leloli aino ng'ana twele baye kulawa mna ighehile agho, nagho ghodununza ghumtingano ghwa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="JOS 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 22:18" />Ule lelo mleka kumuwinza IMNDEWA? Mng'amlema IMNDEWA leloli, ilupfi katsowaghudubukila iwanu wose wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="JOS 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 22:19" />Lelo ka isi yenu iha, mloke na mwingile mna isi ya IMNDEWA, kwalili Lihema lienzeluke, tukale wose mna isi yetu. Lekeni mleke kumlema Imulungu wala kutulema twetwe, kwa kwitsengela matsabahu ingi, ili si ya IMNDEWA baye, Imulungu wetu. <verse eid="JOS 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 22:20" />Apfi Akani mwana wa Zera hayatendile ghehile mna ipfinu ipfilapfighwe kwa Imulungu, imaya ng'ambe iwaghwila iwanu wose wa Isiraeli? Akani ng'afile yaliyeka baye kwa inzambi yake.’ ” <verse eid="JOS 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 22:21" />Kuya iwanu wa likabila lya Rubeni, Gadi, na inusu ya likabila lya Manase wawedika iwakulu wa ghamakabila gha Isiraeli, <verse eid="JOS 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 22:22" />“Imulungu wa milungu yuyo IMNDEWA iyali mkulu! Imulungu wa milungu yuyo IMNDEWA iyali mkulu. Yeye komanya ule tutenda apfo. Na Waisiraeli wose womanya pfipfo. Ka tsa tutotsa au tsa tuleka kumtegheletsa Imulungu, mleke kutuleka waghima. <verse eid="JOS 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 22:23" />Ka tuleka kumuwinza IMNDEWA na kwitsengela wenyegho matsabahu, ili tulapfe nambiko tsa wanyama, na tsa mapfuno, mleke IMNDEWA yatuhighe. <verse eid="JOS 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 22:24" />Mbe! Tutenda apfo kwa kupfuka kwaapfila watsukulu wenu watsowalongela watsukulu wetu, ‘Mwemwe mna choni na Imulungu wa Isiraeli? <verse eid="JOS 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 22:25" />Ng'amkona baye ka IMNDEWA wa Isiraeli keka ghumto Yoridani ghuwe mbaka kuna twetwe na iwanu wa kabila lya Rubeni na Gadi. Mwemwe ng'amwing'ighwe baye isi yoyose na Imulungu.’ Apfo wanenu watsowatenda wanetu waleke kumpfuka IMNDEWA. <verse eid="JOS 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 22:26" />Tutsenga imatsabahu ayo si kwa kutambikila baye wala kulapfila nambiko, <verse eid="JOS 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 22:27" />lekeni chiwe chitango kwa iwanu wetu na iwanu wenu na watsukulu wetu ili tumsang'anile IMNDEWA kubitila nambiko tsetu tsa ukulakatsighwa, nambiko tsa ipfijo na nambiko tsa ukukala tseghamba, ili wanenu waleke kuwalongela wanetu ka wahela chochose kwa IMNDEWA. <verse eid="JOS 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 22:28" />Na tulonga, ‘Ka achino ching'atulawila twetwe au watsukulu wetu, tutsakwidika apfino, mlole wabala wetu watsenga matsabahu si kulapfa nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa wala nambiko tsingi, lekeni chiwe chitango kwa iwanu wetu na iwanu wenu.’ <verse eid="JOS 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 22:29" />Twetwe ng'atubama baye kumlema IMNDEWA na kuleka kumuwinza yeye leloli aino na kutsenga matsabahu ya kulapfila nambiko tsa kulakatsila wanyama, tsa usaghe au nambiko. Nang'atubama baye kulapfila hanu hangi ila hana imatsabahu ya IMNDEWA wetu ili hambele hake hanu hayokala yeye.”<verse eid="JOS 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 22:30" />Mtambika Finehasi, na pfilongotsi wa iwanu na iwakulu wa kolo tsa Isiraeli, tsawatoghola ahala hawahulike aghala ghawalongile ghamakabila gha Rubeni, Gadi na Manase. <verse eid="JOS 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 22:31" />Na Finehasi imwana wa mtambika Eleazari kawalongela iwanu wa likabila lya Rubeni Gadi na Manase, “Leloli twomanya ghendo ka IMNDEWA ka hamwe na twetwe wose, kwaapfila ng'amumlemile baye, apfo muwakombola Waisiraeli waleke kuhighighwa na IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="JOS 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 22:32" />Kuya Finehasi mwana wa mtambika Eliazari na pfilongotsi wayaghe wawaleka iwanu wa likabila lya Rubeni na Gadi mna isi ya Gileadi na woya mna isi ya Kanaani kuwalongela imbuli ayo Waisiraeli. <verse eid="JOS 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 22:33" />Tsawadeng'elela ukuhulika apfo na wamtunya Imulungu na ng'awalongile keli baye imbuli ya ukughenda kwitowa na kuihinya isi yawakalile iwanu wa likabila lya Rubeni na Gadi.<verse eid="JOS 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 22:34" />Iwanu wa likabila lya Rubeni na Gadi waikema imatsabahu aila “Mkalangama, kwaapfila itsakuwa ukalangama kuna twetwe wose na kuna mwemwe ka IMNDEWA yuyo Imulungu.”<verse eid="JOS 22:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOS 23" />
  <para style="s">Yoshua kowawagha iwanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 23:1" />Matsuwa mengi haghamalile, IMNDEWA kawatenda Waisiraeli wabwihile mna ukwitowa na iwanu iwowehila iwang'ali wowatsunguluka. Matsuwa agho Yoshua tsakalala na miyaka yake ipfosa ghendo. <verse eid="JOS 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 23:2" />Yoshua kawakema Waisiraeli wose, iwanzehe wawo, pfilolongotsi wawo, iwakulu wawo na iwalamtsi, kawalongela, “Nene sambi nilala ghendo, <verse eid="JOS 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 23:3" />mwemwe wenyegho mwona aghala ghose IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu ghayatendile kwa iwanu wose wa tsiisi tsose atsino kuna mwemwe. IMNDEWA Imulungu wenu yuyo iyawatowele. <verse eid="JOS 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 23:4" />Mkumbuke pfaniwagholele tsiisi atsila ng'ana nitsitowe baye, na atsila tsose tsanitsitowile tsiwe tsa ghamakabila ghenu kulawa ghumto Yoridani ighuli ubali wa mashariki mbaka kuna ibahari ya Meditaraniya ikalile ubali wa magharibi. <verse eid="JOS 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 23:5" />Yeye IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, katsowalapfa aku mwolola na katsowawinga ghendo mleke kuwona keli, namwe mtsosola isi tsawo, ka IMNDEWA, Imulungu pfayelaghane namwe. <verse eid="JOS 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 23:6" />Apfo mwalangitse na mghatende ghose ighandikighwe mna ichitabu cha ghamalaghitso gha Musa. Mleke kubetsa chinu chochose ichili mumo. <verse eid="JOS 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 23:7" />Mleke kwihanganya na iwanu wa tsiisi iwasighale mna mwemwe, mleke kukema gha mataghwa gha imilungu yawo na mleke kwilahila ghagho, mleke kuisang'anila wala mleke kwinama muitambikile. <verse eid="JOS 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 23:8" />Lekeni mumnanahile ghendo IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu ka pfamlongole kutenda mbaka leloli aino. <verse eid="JOS 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 23:9" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA wenu kawawinga iwanu wakulu na wana ingupfu aku mwemwe wenyegho mwolola, mbaka leloli aino kuduhu munu iyodaha kwima yetowe na mwemwe. <verse eid="JOS 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 23:10" />Munu yumwe iyali mna mwemwe kodaha kuwawinga iwanu elufu imwe, kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu kowatowela mwemwe, ka pfayalongile. <verse eid="JOS 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 23:11" />Apfo mwalangitse ghendo kumkunda IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. <verse eid="JOS 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 23:12" />Lekeni mng'amleka Imulungu na kwihanganya na iwanu iwalekighwe waghima wa tsiisi atso, nawo wang'akwela iwana wenu, namwe mng'akwela iwana wawo, <verse eid="JOS 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 23:13" />mmanye ghendo ka IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, ng'atsowawinga keli baye iwanu awano wa tsiisi itsili hambele henu, lekeni wawo watsakuwa mtegho na nyang'o kuna mwemwe. Kuna mwemwe watsakuwa mbalati ya kuwafapula mna imighongo yenu na mihonga ihoma mnange mwenu. Agha ghatsoghendelela kulawila mbaka mwemwe mhupe ghendo mna isi inoghile iyamwing'ileni IMNDEWA, Imulungu.”<verse eid="JOS 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 23:14" />“Matsuwa ghangu gha ukuhupa ghapfika. Mwemwe mwose mwomanya ghendo mna imimoyo yenu na mna tsimuhe tsenu, ka ghose ighanoghile IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu ghayelaghane na mwemwe ghalawila. Chila chinu chayelaghane na mwemwe chilawila, kuduhu hata chinu chimwe ing'ana chilawile baye. <verse eid="JOS 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 23:15" />Lekeni ka apfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, pfayatendile ghose ighanoghile ghayelaghane na mwemwe ghalawile, pfipfila kodaha kuwaghalila ghehile mbaka yawakomeni ghendo kulawa mna isi inoghile iyaweng'ile. <verse eid="JOS 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 23:16" />Agho ghatsolawila ka mwoleka kulikinda lilaghano lyake IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu, iyawalaghitse mlikinde, na ka mwoghenda kuisang'anila milungu ingi, na kuitambikila, baho imaya ye IMNDEWA, itsomwakilani mwemwe, na mtsohupa ghendo mna isi iyaweng'ileni.”<verse eid="JOS 23:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOS 24" />
  <para style="s">Yoshua kolonga na Waisiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 24:1" />Kuya Yoshua kaghakema hamwe ghamakabila ghose gha Isiraeli akula Shekemu, kawakema iwanzehe, pfilongotsi, walamutsi, na iwakulu wa Isiraeli. Nawo waghenda hambele ha Imulungu. <verse eid="JOS 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 24:2" />Yoshua kawalongela iwanu wose, “Achino chicho chayolonga IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, wabala tsenu aho ghumwande tsawakala kumwambu kwa ghumto Eufurate, waitambikila milungu ingi. Imbala yumwe wa iwabala awo tsakakemighwa Tera, aba wawo Abrahamu na Nahori. <verse eid="JOS 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 24:3" />Nene Imulungu nimlapfa aba wenu Abrahamu kulawa ako kumwambu mwa ghumto Efurate, nimghala akuno Kanaani, aku nimwing'a iwatsukulu wengi. Nimwing'a Isaka, <verse eid="JOS 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 24:4" />naye Isaka nimwing'a wana weli wamale, Yakobo na Esau. Nimwing'a Esau isi ya pfidunda ya Seiri iwe yake, lekeni yeye Yakobo na iwanaghe wahulumka Misiri. <verse eid="JOS 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 24:5" />Kuya niwatuma Musa na Aruni, niwatenda iwanu wa isi ya Misiri waghaye kwa aghala ghaniwatendele, kuya niwalapfa mwemwe mna isi ayo. <verse eid="JOS 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 24:6" />Niwalapfa iwahenga wenu ako Misiri, namwe mpfika mbaka kuna ibahari ya Shamu. Wamisiri tsawawawinza aku wadina mituka yawo na asikali iwadinile wafalasi. <verse eid="JOS 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 24:7" />Waisiraeli hawandilile nene IMNDEWA, nene Imulungu, nyika chisi haghati hawo na Wamisiri, na niitenda ibahari iwaghubike Wamisiri. Mwemwe muwenyegho tsamwona kwa tsinenge tsenu wenyegho achila chaniwatendele Wamisiri.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 24:7">“Kuya mwemwe mkala mnyika kwa matsuwa mengi. <verse eid="JOS 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 24:8" />Kuya niwaghala kuna isi ya Waamori ikalile kumwambu mwa ghumto Yoridani. Tsawetowa na mwemwe, lekeni nene niweka mna ghamoko ghenu, niwakoma hambele henu, namwe muisola isi yawo na iwa yenu. <verse eid="JOS 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 24:9" />Naye Balaki mwana wa Sipori, imfalume wa Moabu, tsakatsa kwitowa namwe. Kamkema Balaamu, imwana wa Beori yatse yawalighite. <verse eid="JOS 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 24:10" />Lekeni nene Imulungu simtegheletse baye Balaamu, apfo yeye kongetsa kuwabaliki, na nene niwalapfa mna ghamoko gha Balaki. <verse eid="JOS 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 24:11" />Kuya mloka ghumto Yoridani na mpfika mna isi ya Yeriko. Iwanu wa Yeriko tsawetowa namwe ka pfawatendile Waamori, Waperizi, Wakanaani, Wahiti, Wagirigashi, Wahivi na Wayebusi. Lekeni nene nimwapfilani na muwatowa wose. <verse eid="JOS 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 24:12" />Tsanituma malondola ghawalongolele, wawawinga iwafalume weli wa Waamori. Namwe ng'amuwawingile baye kwa mimaghe wala kwa mighoha yenu. <verse eid="JOS 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 24:13" />Tsanimwing'ani imighunda, ng'amuilimile baye, na nimwing'ani imiji aila ing'amuitsengile, lekeni sambi mwokala mna imiji ayo na mwakuja mitsabibu na mitseituni aila ing'amuihandandile. <verse eid="JOS 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 24:14" />Lelo mpfukeni IMNDEWA, msang'anileni yeye kwa ghumoyo ghunoghile na kwa kutogholighwa, ilekeni ghendo imilungu aila yawaitambikile iwahenga wenu akula kumwambu mwa ghumto Eufurate na akula mna isi ya Misiri, msang'anileni IMNDEWA yaliyeka. <verse eid="JOS 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 24:15" />Ka ng'ambama baye kumsang'anila IMNDEWA, lelo leloli aino msaghule yuhi yamutsomsang'anila, ka imilungu aila iwaisang'anile wahenga wenu akula kumwambu mwa ghumto Efurate, au imilungu ya Waamori mwamkala sambi mna isi yawo, lekeni nene na ng'anda yangu twomsang'anila IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="JOS 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 24:16" />Baho iwanu wamwidika, “Ng'atutsomleka baye IMNDEWA wetu na kuisang'anila milungu ingi! <verse eid="JOS 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 24:17" />Kwaapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu yuyo iyatulapfile twetwe na iwahenga wetu Misiri, kulawa mna isi ya utumwa, twona kwa tsinenge tsetu ipfinu pfa kukangawatsa pfayatendile. Katukinga mnzila mwose mwatwang'ile na mna isi tsa iwanu mwatubitile. <verse eid="JOS 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 24:18" />Na Imulungu tsakatuwingila iwanu wa isi tsose, awo Waamori iwakalile mna isi aino. Apfo twetwe pfipfila tutsomsang'anila IMNDEWA, kwaapfila yeye ka Imulungu wetu.”<verse eid="JOS 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 24:19" />Lekeni Yoshua kawedika, “Mwemwe ng'amdaha baye kumsang'anila IMNDEWA, kwaapfila Yeye ka Imulungu yenzeluke, ka Imulungu iyana gele, yeye ng'atsoghalekelela baye ighehile ghenu na matotso ghenu. <verse eid="JOS 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 24:20" />Mng'amleka Imulungu, na kuisang'anila milungu ingi, katsowahundukila na kuwaghalila maghayo na kuwakomani ghendo, hata ka yeye tsakawatendela ghanoghile.”<verse eid="JOS 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 24:21" />Lekeni iwanu wamwidika Yoshua, “Mbe! Twetwe tutsomsang'anila IMNDEWA yaliyeka.”<verse eid="JOS 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 24:22" />Baho Yoshua kawedika, “Mwemwe wenyegho mwolonga ichili mmoyo mwenu ka mwosaghula kumsang'anila IMNDEWA.” Nawo wamwidika, “Ona twetwe yatulonga apfo.”<verse eid="JOS 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 24:23" />Naye kawedika, “Muyase milungu migheni yamli nayo na mumuwinze IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli kwa ghumoyo ghwenu ghwose.”<verse eid="JOS 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 24:24" />Iwanu wamlongela Yoshua, “Tutsomsang'anila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu na kumtegheletsa yeye.”<verse eid="JOS 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 24:25" />Apfo tsuwa alyo Yoshua keka laghano na Waisiraeli ako Shekemu, kaweng'a imiko ya ukukinda na malaghitso gha kughawinza. <verse eid="JOS 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 24:26" />Yoshua kaghandika agha ghose mna ichitabu cha Imulungu cha malaghitso, kuya kasola libwe kulu na kulimitsa hasi ha ghumbiki ghwa mwaloni habehi na hanu haenzeluke ha IMNDEWA. <verse eid="JOS 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 24:27" />Yoshua kawalongela iwanu wose, “Mlole! Libwe alino lihulika chatulongile wose. Lihulika ghose ghayalongile Imulungu kuna twetwe, litsolonga ka mtsombela Imulungu wenu.” <verse eid="JOS 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 24:28" />Kuya Yoshua kawaleka iwanu woke, chila munu koka ukaye yake.<verse eid="JOS 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yoshua na Eleazari wakufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 24:29" />Haghamalile agho, Yoshua mwana wa Nuni, imtumighwa wa Imulungu kafa aku kana miyaka miya imwe na kumi. <verse eid="JOS 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 24:30" />Apfo Wamtsika mna isi iyagholighwe iwe yake, ako Timati Sela ili mna ipfidunda pfa Efuraimu, kasikazini mwa ichidunda cha Gaashi. <verse eid="JOS 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 24:31" />Waisiraeli wamsang'anila IMNDEWA matsuwa ghose Yoshua hayakalile mghima, na ahala hayafile waghendelela kumsang'anila IMNDEWA kwa matsuwa ghose ghawakalile waghima iwabala awala iwonile kwa tsinenge tsawo pfinu pfikulu pfayatendile IMNDEWA kwa Waisiraeli. <verse eid="JOS 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 24:32" />Imipate ya Yosefu yawaidutile Waisiraeli kulawa Misiri, itsikighwa akula Shekemu hana ingwe iyaghulile Yakobu kulawa kwa mwana wa Hamori, aba wake Shekemu, kwa tobole miya imwe. Ingwe ayo iwa mali ya iwana wa Yosefu. <verse eid="JOS 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 24:33" />Naye Eleazari Mwana wa Aruni, kafa na katsikighwa Gibea, ghumji ghwayeng'ighwe imwanaghe Finehasi mna isi ya ipfidunda pfa Efuraimu.<verse eid="JOS 24:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 24" />
</usx>